(2614824, 362524, 57202, '<td valign="top">Excellent theme!  I love the composition of this shot, love the colors, and think the melting globe gets the point across perfectly.  Well done!</td>', 'Excellent theme!  I love the composition of this shot, love the colors, and think the melting globe gets the point across perfectly.  Well done!', '2006-07-12 13:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
