(2615469, 362140, 60995, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, i really like it. Interesting perspective and great lighting and lines.  I think I would prefer it without the cars--it kind of detracts from the modernity and mystery of the photo.</td>', 'Cool photo, i really like it. Interesting perspective and great lighting and lines.  I think I would prefer it without the cars--it kind of detracts from the modernity and mystery of the photo.', '2006-07-12 16:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
