(2615522, 362213, 60995, '<td valign="top">Why is the guy in there?  And it looks like he has a fairy light coming out of his stomach. Nice smoke.</td>', 'Why is the guy in there?  And it looks like he has a fairy light coming out of his stomach. Nice smoke.', '2006-07-12 16:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615524, 360248, 60995, '<td valign="top">It looks as though the last kid is about the slide off the bench b/c it and the ground isn''t level.  Cute photo, though.</td>', 'It looks as though the last kid is about the slide off the bench b/c it and the ground isn''t level.  Cute photo, though.', '2006-07-12 16:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615527, 362524, 60995, '<td valign="top">Interesting effects.</td>', 'Interesting effects.', '2006-07-12 16:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615530, 362188, 61971, '<td valign="top">I love the idea. I miss the romance of writing love letters. Somehow the typed ones on phones all look the same.</td>', 'I love the idea. I miss the romance of writing love letters. Somehow the typed ones on phones all look the same.', '2006-07-12 16:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615533, 359277, 60995, '<td valign="top">Love the concept.  Seems a bit out of focus/blurry and the purple light on the tomato jar seems out of place, like a tv reflection?</td>', 'Love the concept.  Seems a bit out of focus/blurry and the purple light on the tomato jar seems out of place, like a tv reflection?', '2006-07-12 17:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615536, 362042, 60995, '<td valign="top">Overexposed sky. Small photo.</td>', 'Overexposed sky. Small photo.', '2006-07-12 17:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615542, 360967, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great picture. I am not sure if you  ment it to be or not but the wedding band is the main focus for me here. Too many people don''t get it that it takes years of practice and hard work for a marriage to work. It is way too easy to just walk away in today''s world!</td>', 'Great picture. I am not sure if you  ment it to be or not but the wedding band is the main focus for me here. Too many people don''t get it that it takes years of practice and hard work for a marriage to work. It is way too easy to just walk away in today''s world!', '2006-07-12 17:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
