(2616728, 362531, 28029, '<td valign="top">Gotta give you an 8 for humor. You need to watch your unlevel horizon, and some more use of basic post processing tools would help. But a good laugh. Thanks.</td>', 'Gotta give you an 8 for humor. You need to watch your unlevel horizon, and some more use of basic post processing tools would help. But a good laugh. Thanks.', '2006-07-12 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616732, 362209, 28029, '<td valign="top">hate the border- really distracts. Don''t really get the link... 6</td>', 'hate the border- really distracts. Don''t really get the link... 6', '2006-07-12 22:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616739, 361151, 28029, '<td valign="top">I like the irony. But progress?</td>', 'I like the irony. But progress?', '2006-07-12 22:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616766, 362294, 28029, '<td valign="top">Perfect for the challenge. Well executed. impressive POV. Very well done. B&amp;W works well. 9</td>', 'Perfect for the challenge. Well executed. impressive POV. Very well done. B&W works well. 9', '2006-07-12 22:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616797, 362367, 54475, '<td valign="top">nice picture, I like this one 10</td>', 'nice picture, I like this one 10', '2006-07-12 22:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616799, 362246, 46336, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot - doing the old classic complementary colours thing. I believe I would have liked it more rotated counter-clockwise 90 degrees (or so). This I think would have been better balanced, and led the eye through the progress of unripe in the foreground and ripe in the background.</td>', 'I do like this shot - doing the old classic complementary colours thing. I believe I would have liked it more rotated counter-clockwise 90 degrees (or so). This I think would have been better balanced, and led the eye through the progress of unripe in the foreground and ripe in the background.', '2006-07-12 22:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616842, 361568, 35334, '<td valign="top">This certainly shows a lot of progress. I hope that it reaches a good conclusion at the appropriate time. (10)</td>', 'This certainly shows a lot of progress. I hope that it reaches a good conclusion at the appropriate time. (10)', '2006-07-12 23:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616849, 362486, 35334, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is lyrical! I love the combination of roads and rails. (10)</td>', 'Yes, this is lyrical! I love the combination of roads and rails. (10)', '2006-07-12 23:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616855, 362367, 35334, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! This is the best interpretation of a "work in progress" among all the entries. (10)</td>', 'Wonderful! This is the best interpretation of a "work in progress" among all the entries. (10)', '2006-07-12 23:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616867, 362176, 35334, '<td valign="top">This is great! Both the green tree and the reflected image of construction raise questions about whether the austere modern building is really progress. (10)</td>', 'This is great! Both the green tree and the reflected image of construction raise questions about whether the austere modern building is really progress. (10)', '2006-07-12 23:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616890, 362466, 35334, '<td valign="top">Every kid is making progress but this is the only image in the challenge that I think successfully conveys the difficulties and successes of moving along the developmental path. (10)</td>', 'Every kid is making progress but this is the only image in the challenge that I think successfully conveys the difficulties and successes of moving along the developmental path. (10)', '2006-07-12 23:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616902, 362175, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colours. The OOF guy in the back is spot on and it sure does depict progress.</td>', 'Great composition and colours. The OOF guy in the back is spot on and it sure does depict progress.', '2006-07-12 23:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616936, 360314, 35334, '<td valign="top">I have a strong feeling that I am missing the point of this. It is OK as a photo but I don''t see any connection to the idea of progress. I did a google search for both harf and H.A.R.F. and I did not find anything that helped me understand this. The links I found verified Turkish and other Arabic connections which fit the Arabic letter forms in the photo. Sorry. (3)</td>', 'I have a strong feeling that I am missing the point of this. It is OK as a photo but I don''t see any connection to the idea of progress. I did a google search for both harf and H.A.R.F. and I did not find anything that helped me understand this. The links I found verified Turkish and other Arabic connections which fit the Arabic letter forms in the photo. Sorry. (3)', '2006-07-12 23:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616937, 362521, 23430, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble getting my shoes on lately would you have anything handy to help?  ;~) Sorry to be a smarty but without seeing your previous modelling shots the viewercannot relate to the progress spoken of in your title. Other than that it''s a good shot. Good crop, different angle which is OK and a good from your model expression. Lighting is very slightly too strong on the left and a bit shadowy on the right but not by a lot.</td>', 'I''m having trouble getting my shoes on lately would you have anything handy to help?  ;~) Sorry to be a smarty but without seeing your previous modelling shots the viewercannot relate to the progress spoken of in your title. Other than that it''s a good shot. Good crop, different angle which is OK and a good from your model expression. Lighting is very slightly too strong on the left and a bit shadowy on the right but not by a lot.', '2006-07-12 23:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616946, 359868, 60581, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken!!!!</td>', 'Nicely taken!!!!', '2006-07-12 23:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
