(2616968, 362035, 23430, '<td valign="top">This is a good find and idea. You''ve composed this well too. I think stronger contrast and make the sky a bit darker with selective colour if you''re using PS would have helped make this an even better shot.</td>', 'This is a good find and idea. You''ve composed this well too. I think stronger contrast and make the sky a bit darker with selective colour if you''re using PS would have helped make this an even better shot.', '2006-07-12 23:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2616984, 362494, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great shot but would have been a top shot if you had a log raft bottom left.</td>', 'Great shot but would have been a top shot if you had a log raft bottom left.', '2006-07-12 23:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617000, 361459, 23430, '<td valign="top">Well presented, you can sense the progress. DOF is great. My only gripe is what you have and haven''t chopped off in the background.</td>', 'Well presented, you can sense the progress. DOF is great. My only gripe is what you have and haven''t chopped off in the background.', '2006-07-13 00:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617117, 362381, 59754, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I can''t give this a high score.  It''s a very opinionated photo, which would be great, but it simply has no composure and even with the title only reaches a very niche audience of environmentalists.  It''s not a terrible picture, but it''s also not great.</td>', 'Sorry but I can''t give this a high score.  It''s a very opinionated photo, which would be great, but it simply has no composure and even with the title only reaches a very niche audience of environmentalists.  It''s not a terrible picture, but it''s also not great.', '2006-07-13 00:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617123, 362040, 59754, '<td valign="top">Neat photo, and I like the theme.  I would suggest however either desaturating or shifting the hue to make the ''paper'' or whatever they are marching on more white.  The yellow tint bothers me a small bit.  A diffused flash from the side might have added detail to the chips as well.  Good luck</td>', 'Neat photo, and I like the theme.  I would suggest however either desaturating or shifting the hue to make the ''paper'' or whatever they are marching on more white.  The yellow tint bothers me a small bit.  A diffused flash from the side might have added detail to the chips as well.  Good luck', '2006-07-13 00:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617133, 362063, 58634, '<td valign="top">Good picture. <br/>Including the whole sign would''ve made it 10 times better</td>', 'Good picture. Including the whole sign would''ve made it 10 times better', '2006-07-13 00:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617137, 360899, 59754, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, you should think about investing in a lens with ''prettier'' bokeh.  The background was not distracting enough to dock any points though, wonderful catch and best of luck!</td>', 'Wonderful photo, you should think about investing in a lens with ''prettier'' bokeh.  The background was not distracting enough to dock any points though, wonderful catch and best of luck!', '2006-07-13 00:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
