(2617162, 359298, 59754, '<td valign="top">Awww, look at their adorable...spinal cords...and veins...<br/> <br/>In seriousness I do like this photo because it really meets the challenge in a very clear cut way- Progress.  In this case, progress of life.  The lighting is a bit harsh and the lens was clearly limiting, but I do like this photo and wish you good luck.</td>', 'Awww, look at their adorable...spinal cords...and veins... In seriousness I do like this photo because it really meets the challenge in a very clear cut way- Progress.  In this case, progress of life.  The lighting is a bit harsh and the lens was clearly limiting, but I do like this photo and wish you good luck.', '2006-07-13 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617171, 362094, 59754, '<td valign="top">I''m trying really hard to think outside the box, but neither the photo nor the title queue the idea of "progress" into my mind.  It is a nice picture aside from that, and the lighting is awsome.</td>', 'I''m trying really hard to think outside the box, but neither the photo nor the title queue the idea of "progress" into my mind.  It is a nice picture aside from that, and the lighting is awsome.', '2006-07-13 00:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617175, 360077, 59754, '<td valign="top">The saturation effect here is actually to my liking, just try to keep from blowing the shadows out (they turn grey, like in the lighter) next time.  Meets challenge well in a semi-humorous way, something I really liked about it.</td>', 'The saturation effect here is actually to my liking, just try to keep from blowing the shadows out (they turn grey, like in the lighter) next time.  Meets challenge well in a semi-humorous way, something I really liked about it.', '2006-07-13 00:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
