(2618478, 360802, 61818, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot.  I was wondering how many of the obligatory flower (and bug and kids) shots would actually be relevant.  You really pulled it off.</td>', 'A very nice shot.  I was wondering how many of the obligatory flower (and bug and kids) shots would actually be relevant.  You really pulled it off.', '2006-07-13 11:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618489, 360692, 61818, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Obviously not easy to set up the shot but with some sky between the planes it would have worked better.</td>', 'Very cool.  Obviously not easy to set up the shot but with some sky between the planes it would have worked better.', '2006-07-13 11:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618491, 362246, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but can''t tell if it''s oversharp or the exposure os odd or...something is up.</td>', 'Nice concept but can''t tell if it''s oversharp or the exposure os odd or...something is up.', '2006-07-13 11:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618494, 362148, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Maybe don''t crop so much from the bottom, would be nice to see more of the egg pile and the chicken.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Maybe don''t crop so much from the bottom, would be nice to see more of the egg pile and the chicken.', '2006-07-13 11:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618496, 360795, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is probably the most original concept in this challenge.  A subtle, well executed depiction of world politics and history.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is probably the most original concept in this challenge.  A subtle, well executed depiction of world politics and history.  Nice job.', '2006-07-13 11:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618503, 362508, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and the layout.  I think it would have worked better as far as presenting the ''tonal progression'' idea if you dumped the two nanos and put in a casette and/or cd.</td>', 'I like the shot and the layout.  I think it would have worked better as far as presenting the ''tonal progression'' idea if you dumped the two nanos and put in a casette and/or cd.', '2006-07-13 11:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618506, 361151, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.</td>', 'Nice concept.', '2006-07-13 11:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618511, 361488, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is very cool.  Had there been a ten speed in the middle or some sort of bicycle to complete the progression of what it is you are showing, I''d have voted this a ten.  As it stands, boys apparently go toyless between trikes and motorcycles lol.  Still a really cool shot, good job.</td>', 'This is very cool.  Had there been a ten speed in the middle or some sort of bicycle to complete the progression of what it is you are showing, I''d have voted this a ten.  As it stands, boys apparently go toyless between trikes and motorcycles lol.  Still a really cool shot, good job.', '2006-07-13 11:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618528, 360357, 61818, '<td valign="top">Lots of these shots in the challenge.  This one works well especially because the player and lp both have that nice red.  I think it would have worked even better had you made an mp3 with artist=doris day and title=something from the label of that lp so the connection between the two would be even stronger.  Nice shot overall.</td>', 'Lots of these shots in the challenge.  This one works well especially because the player and lp both have that nice red.  I think it would have worked even better had you made an mp3 with artist=doris day and title=something from the label of that lp so the connection between the two would be even stronger.  Nice shot overall.', '2006-07-13 11:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618534, 360077, 61818, '<td valign="top">I expected to see more entries with this theme but there aren''t so grats on originality.  The post processing really blows it for me, but otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'I expected to see more entries with this theme but there aren''t so grats on originality.  The post processing really blows it for me, but otherwise a nice shot.', '2006-07-13 11:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618536, 362163, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot but it almost looks like you focused on the rock and not the birds?</td>', 'This is a nice shot but it almost looks like you focused on the rock and not the birds?', '2006-07-13 11:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618537, 360209, 61818, '<td valign="top">Really nice, way to go.</td>', 'Really nice, way to go.', '2006-07-13 11:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618545, 360209, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice twilight colors and cool reflections on the ripples.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice twilight colors and cool reflections on the ripples.  Well done!', '2006-07-13 11:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618611, 360795, 61679, '<td valign="top">The technical aspects of this image are well done (exposure, focus, selective desaturation).  The image has very little emotional content imho and probably not score very well.</td>', 'The technical aspects of this image are well done (exposure, focus, selective desaturation).  The image has very little emotional content imho and probably not score very well.', '2006-07-13 12:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618615, 362489, 61679, '<td valign="top">The color tone of this image are very interesting and work very nicely imho.  The costume looks a bit fake and cropping at the ankles hurts the composition of the photo.</td>', 'The color tone of this image are very interesting and work very nicely imho.  The costume looks a bit fake and cropping at the ankles hurts the composition of the photo.', '2006-07-13 12:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618619, 361971, 61679, '<td valign="top">The photo says Pose, Pose, Pose not Practice, Practice, Practice, as the subjects are looking directly at the camera.  I like the sepia tone and the film grain feel to this image but if the image had a bit of motion blur it would have conveyed practice a bit more strongly.</td>', 'The photo says Pose, Pose, Pose not Practice, Practice, Practice, as the subjects are looking directly at the camera.  I like the sepia tone and the film grain feel to this image but if the image had a bit of motion blur it would have conveyed practice a bit more strongly.', '2006-07-13 12:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618625, 362203, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image conveys progress very well but the focal point is on the curb instead of the de-construction in the background.  If the heavy machinery was in focus, you could crop off the bottom half of this image and have a much stronger entry.</td>', 'This image conveys progress very well but the focal point is on the curb instead of the de-construction in the background.  If the heavy machinery was in focus, you could crop off the bottom half of this image and have a much stronger entry.', '2006-07-13 12:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
