(2620602, 362035, 36382, '<td valign="top">Yep.  the irony is what makes this shot 8 for me.</td>', 'Yep.  the irony is what makes this shot 8 for me.', '2006-07-13 23:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620603, 360926, 61901, '<td valign="top">Nice objects, but the surface is too busy, and by putting the old iron in focus and the other out it is almost like saying the older one is the more progressed! I guess it is...agewise.</td>', 'Nice objects, but the surface is too busy, and by putting the old iron in focus and the other out it is almost like saying the older one is the more progressed! I guess it is...agewise.', '2006-07-13 23:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620604, 360205, 36382, '<td valign="top">Very good.  I like his expression.</td>', 'Very good.  I like his expression.', '2006-07-13 23:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620606, 362494, 36382, '<td valign="top">Bit of a stretch but I like the lighting so much I can''t penalise it.</td>', 'Bit of a stretch but I like the lighting so much I can''t penalise it.', '2006-07-13 23:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620608, 362058, 36382, '<td valign="top">A sweet picture</td>', 'A sweet picture', '2006-07-13 23:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620609, 362063, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I can''t figure out what that thing is that my eye is drawn to at the end of the road.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I can''t figure out what that thing is that my eye is drawn to at the end of the road.', '2006-07-13 23:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620612, 361402, 36382, '<td valign="top">You did a good job with the repetition of shape in the stone heaps and the clouds too to some extent.  That is what makes the picture work for me.</td>', 'You did a good job with the repetition of shape in the stone heaps and the clouds too to some extent.  That is what makes the picture work for me.', '2006-07-13 23:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620613, 362208, 36382, '<td valign="top">The snail has come out really nicely and I like how you tilted it so that it is going uphill.  The only nitpic is that dark triangle in the lower left corner.  I find it a little bit distracting.  Still a cool picture that deserves 7 from me.</td>', 'The snail has come out really nicely and I like how you tilted it so that it is going uphill.  The only nitpic is that dark triangle in the lower left corner.  I find it a little bit distracting.  Still a cool picture that deserves 7 from me.', '2006-07-13 23:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620614, 362510, 36382, '<td valign="top">Intriguing</td>', 'Intriguing', '2006-07-13 23:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620616, 362134, 61901, '<td valign="top">I see shat you are doing here, but for me the out-of-focus broken glass in the foregroud detracts.  It does give it a uniqueness though.</td>', 'I see shat you are doing here, but for me the out-of-focus broken glass in the foregroud detracts.  It does give it a uniqueness though.', '2006-07-13 23:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620617, 360289, 36382, '<td valign="top">Nice range of tones.  Black and white is nice</td>', 'Nice range of tones.  Black and white is nice', '2006-07-13 23:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620625, 362131, 61901, '<td valign="top">Thsi image makes me nervous.  I hope the rennovators know what they are doing!  Personally, I would like to see all of the scalloped edge along the top to anchor my eye.  All four edges are broken.  I like your concept, though.</td>', 'Thsi image makes me nervous.  I hope the rennovators know what they are doing!  Personally, I would like to see all of the scalloped edge along the top to anchor my eye.  All four edges are broken.  I like your concept, though.', '2006-07-13 23:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620626, 359608, 36382, '<td valign="top">Great moment you captured here.  Just seems a little bit on the light side.  Easily fixed, still like it.</td>', 'Great moment you captured here.  Just seems a little bit on the light side.  Easily fixed, still like it.', '2006-07-13 23:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620632, 361670, 61901, '<td valign="top">Sweet.  Reminds me of a Van Gogh.  I find myself wanting a little more detail in the figure...maybe more face detail, or maybe hands?</td>', 'Sweet.  Reminds me of a Van Gogh.  I find myself wanting a little more detail in the figure...maybe more face detail, or maybe hands?', '2006-07-13 23:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620643, 360077, 61901, '<td valign="top">Thank you!  It is so hard, but you gotta start somewhere!  Like your composition and color choices, too.</td>', 'Thank you!  It is so hard, but you gotta start somewhere!  Like your composition and color choices, too.', '2006-07-13 23:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620653, 360894, 61901, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m depressed.  I like this photo, but something about it could be "punchier"...more light on the surface, crisper focus.</td>', 'OK, I''m depressed.  I like this photo, but something about it could be "punchier"...more light on the surface, crisper focus.', '2006-07-13 23:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620659, 361488, 36382, '<td valign="top">Clever idea</td>', 'Clever idea', '2006-07-13 23:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620660, 362137, 36382, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette.  Would have preferred more space beneath his feet.</td>', 'Nice silhouette.  Would have preferred more space beneath his feet.', '2006-07-13 23:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620661, 362524, 36382, '<td valign="top">Good idea, very current.  I think the idea has a lot of potential and if you were going to do more with it, I''d suggest a different base or shooting from a lower angle so that you see less of it.  Still like it 7.</td>', 'Good idea, very current.  I think the idea has a lot of potential and if you were going to do more with it, I''d suggest a different base or shooting from a lower angle so that you see less of it.  Still like it 7.', '2006-07-13 23:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620667, 362345, 61901, '<td valign="top">Hopefully it was an eery effect you were going for?  I''m not sure if the figure in the backround is a bride or a ghost.  I appreciate the composition, but the gesture of the figure leaves me confused...what are the hands saying?</td>', 'Hopefully it was an eery effect you were going for?  I''m not sure if the figure in the backround is a bride or a ghost.  I appreciate the composition, but the gesture of the figure leaves me confused...what are the hands saying?', '2006-07-13 23:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620671, 362053, 61901, '<td valign="top">Aren''t you clever!</td>', 'Aren''t you clever!', '2006-07-13 23:33:51.000000', NULL, 1);
