(2622846, 362203, 62095, '<td valign="top">I''m funny about things being chopped off, so would have liked to see the top of the crane top left.</td>', 'I''m funny about things being chopped off, so would have liked to see the top of the crane top left.', '2006-07-14 17:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622855, 359641, 62095, '<td valign="top">Good colour and definition, I like it.</td>', 'Good colour and definition, I like it.', '2006-07-14 17:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622864, 362326, 62095, '<td valign="top">I had to look very closely to see the person.</td>', 'I had to look very closely to see the person.', '2006-07-14 17:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622869, 360357, 60987, '<td valign="top">well i like. good idea and nice uce of ''noise'' in the colour.</td>', 'well i like. good idea and nice uce of ''noise'' in the colour.', '2006-07-14 17:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622876, 362524, 60987, '<td valign="top">ahhh wel done</td>', 'ahhh wel done', '2006-07-14 17:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622880, 362325, 36382, '<td valign="top">Not only does the little girl progress, but the pictures also show photographic progress :)  Neat idea.</td>', 'Not only does the little girl progress, but the pictures also show photographic progress :)  Neat idea.', '2006-07-14 17:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622882, 362208, 60987, '<td valign="top">always an uphill battle! hehe. colourfull critters ain''t they.</td>', 'always an uphill battle! hehe. colourfull critters ain''t they.', '2006-07-14 17:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622892, 361568, 60987, '<td valign="top">well lit and definatley progressive, they never stop (babies that is!) respect to your model as well,any pregnant woman that will take her clothes off for a photo deservse it.</td>', 'well lit and definatley progressive, they never stop (babies that is!) respect to your model as well,any pregnant woman that will take her clothes off for a photo deservse it.', '2006-07-14 17:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622913, 362515, 23430, '<td valign="top">Hilarious. This is a ripper shot. I like the diffrent angle you got and your model who so generously played along.</td>', 'Hilarious. This is a ripper shot. I like the diffrent angle you got and your model who so generously played along.', '2006-07-14 17:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622915, 362489, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great composition.</td>', 'Great composition.', '2006-07-14 17:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622920, 362367, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Good composition and good clarity on the foreground. The moment of capture is great and your title says it well.</td>', 'Great shot. Good composition and good clarity on the foreground. The moment of capture is great and your title says it well.', '2006-07-14 17:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622928, 361670, 23430, '<td valign="top">The desat works very well here. Love the sky and the whole scene.</td>', 'The desat works very well here. Love the sky and the whole scene.', '2006-07-14 17:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622936, 361123, 23430, '<td valign="top">Well depicted with this angle.</td>', 'Well depicted with this angle.', '2006-07-14 17:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622971, 362476, 49926, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!!', '2006-07-14 18:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622975, 362353, 26633, '<td valign="top">I can''t claim to understand this picture at all so I shouldn''t really vote on it but it is annoying seeing it sit there on screen above the single 10 I awarded. I suppose all will be revealed after the challenge, but it doesn''t look like a photograph, it just doesn''t look like anything. It''s the only 3 I''m going to give in the challenge.</td>', 'I can''t claim to understand this picture at all so I shouldn''t really vote on it but it is annoying seeing it sit there on screen above the single 10 I awarded. I suppose all will be revealed after the challenge, but it doesn''t look like a photograph, it just doesn''t look like anything. It''s the only 3 I''m going to give in the challenge.', '2006-07-14 18:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622980, 362294, 26633, '<td valign="top">Great perpective and expression. I''d be interested to know why the photographer converted this to monochrome. 7.</td>', 'Great perpective and expression. I''d be interested to know why the photographer converted this to monochrome. 7.', '2006-07-14 18:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622985, 359936, 62095, '<td valign="top">Cracking.  Personally I''d have a tighter crop, as I think the nest and greenery are a bit dead.</td>', 'Cracking.  Personally I''d have a tighter crop, as I think the nest and greenery are a bit dead.', '2006-07-14 18:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622987, 360209, 62095, '<td valign="top">Love the colours here</td>', 'Love the colours here', '2006-07-14 18:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622990, 362052, 62095, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure of the connection to the theme, and the text is unreal.</td>', 'I''m not sure of the connection to the theme, and the text is unreal.', '2006-07-14 18:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622996, 361053, 62095, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, the distracting elements for me though are the half a window and two-thirds of a lamp near the top right. It bugs me when things get chopped off like that.  I think the picture looks a lot better if it''s cropped in a line below the guttering.</td>', 'I like the idea here, the distracting elements for me though are the half a window and two-thirds of a lamp near the top right. It bugs me when things get chopped off like that.  I think the picture looks a lot better if it''s cropped in a line below the guttering.', '2006-07-14 18:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623000, 361633, 62095, '<td valign="top">I like the focus and the way that the mp3 player towers obelisk-like over the tape.  And I can relate to it, my tapes are consigned to obscurity :)</td>', 'I like the focus and the way that the mp3 player towers obelisk-like over the tape.  And I can relate to it, my tapes are consigned to obscurity :)', '2006-07-14 18:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623004, 362353, 62095, '<td valign="top">It''s a pink squirly smudge.</td>', 'It''s a pink squirly smudge.', '2006-07-14 18:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623008, 359879, 62095, '<td valign="top">If only there wasn''t half a person in it..</td>', 'If only there wasn''t half a person in it..', '2006-07-14 18:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623013, 362163, 62095, '<td valign="top">Amusing and on topic.</td>', 'Amusing and on topic.', '2006-07-14 18:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623041, 362353, 29269, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, not quite sure how to interpret this one... wait... I''m out of the box now but I still don''t see it. There''s still 5 days left to vote, maybe I''ll get it.</td>', 'Hmmm, not quite sure how to interpret this one... wait... I''m out of the box now but I still don''t see it. There''s still 5 days left to vote, maybe I''ll get it.', '2006-07-14 18:54:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2623061, 362531, 58452, '<td valign="top">Dr.  Achoo?  Is that you????  ;)</td>', 'Dr.  Achoo?  Is that you????  ;)', '2006-07-14 19:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623339, 362325, 23430, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2006-07-14 21:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623534, 362209, 38032, '<td valign="top">that''s pretty cool.</td>', 'that''s pretty cool.', '2006-07-14 22:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623537, 362058, 38032, '<td valign="top">i like the confident expression :)</td>', 'i like the confident expression :)', '2006-07-14 22:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623540, 360209, 38032, '<td valign="top">beauty</td>', 'beauty', '2006-07-14 22:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623684, 360357, 29269, '<td valign="top">smart photo - everything is in details. red &amp; black is just the added bonus.</td>', 'smart photo - everything is in details. red & black is just the added bonus.', '2006-07-14 23:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623691, 362381, 29269, '<td valign="top">Does it run on batteries?</td>', 'Does it run on batteries?', '2006-07-14 23:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623717, 359608, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Very creative seating.  Nice basic composition; bit "middle of the day" lighting, but overall a decent shot and definitely meets the challenge.</td>', 'Heh!  Very creative seating.  Nice basic composition; bit "middle of the day" lighting, but overall a decent shot and definitely meets the challenge.', '2006-07-14 23:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623720, 362050, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, great focus on detail.  Good challenge entry but may not be quite as compelling outside of the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely framed, great focus on detail.  Good challenge entry but may not be quite as compelling outside of the challenge.', '2006-07-14 23:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623723, 361123, 30982, '<td valign="top">Did meet challenge.  Nice juxtaposition - light is a bit harsh but not too detrimentally so.</td>', 'Did meet challenge.  Nice juxtaposition - light is a bit harsh but not too detrimentally so.', '2006-07-14 23:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623726, 362104, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yep, meets challenge, but why is he holding his nose?</td>', 'Yep, meets challenge, but why is he holding his nose?', '2006-07-14 23:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623730, 360967, 30982, '<td valign="top">The focus here appears to be on the wedding band, which could be "progress" requiring practice as well.</td>', 'The focus here appears to be on the wedding band, which could be "progress" requiring practice as well.', '2006-07-14 23:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623736, 362148, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well posed!  Gotta wonder how the eggs are staying that way.</td>', 'Well posed!  Gotta wonder how the eggs are staying that way.', '2006-07-14 23:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623741, 362049, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m going to interpret this as "progressing down the aisle", but I suspect it would be more suited for "Perspective" and your scores may reflect that.</td>', 'I''m going to interpret this as "progressing down the aisle", but I suspect it would be more suited for "Perspective" and your scores may reflect that.', '2006-07-14 23:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623747, 359298, 30982, '<td valign="top">They''re really ugly at this point, aren''t they?  Square crop works well; nice detail.</td>', 'They''re really ugly at this point, aren''t they?  Square crop works well; nice detail.', '2006-07-14 23:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623752, 359150, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the high key treatment - it''s almost an abstract.</td>', 'I like the high key treatment - it''s almost an abstract.', '2006-07-14 23:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623759, 361868, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like lack of progress, kinda, though the cement looks reasonably new.  Not quite sure on the title in what is meant by "sprouts".</td>', 'Looks like lack of progress, kinda, though the cement looks reasonably new.  Not quite sure on the title in what is meant by "sprouts".', '2006-07-14 23:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623764, 360209, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice simple lines and colors.  I particularly like the ribbons in the water.</td>', 'Nice simple lines and colors.  I particularly like the ribbons in the water.', '2006-07-14 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623767, 362494, 30982, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this plays more like "success" or "wealth", but I''ll accept it as progress.  Well composed, lovely light.</td>', 'Without the title, this plays more like "success" or "wealth", but I''ll accept it as progress.  Well composed, lovely light.', '2006-07-14 23:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623772, 359232, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece of metal.  Not sure it screams "Progress" but it at least refers to it tangentially.  The picture itself lacks a little in depth, probably due to the lighting conditions.</td>', 'Interesting piece of metal.  Not sure it screams "Progress" but it at least refers to it tangentially.  The picture itself lacks a little in depth, probably due to the lighting conditions.', '2006-07-14 23:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623860, 362090, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  I found myself trying to figure out in what this was reflected - I suspect a car mirror because I can see other cars in the reflection.</td>', 'I like the concept.  I found myself trying to figure out in what this was reflected - I suspect a car mirror because I can see other cars in the reflection.', '2006-07-15 00:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623862, 362131, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the natural framing - that''s a LOT of scaffolding!</td>', 'I like the natural framing - that''s a LOT of scaffolding!', '2006-07-15 00:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623865, 360205, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate take on the challenge - progress both mechanical and that brought about by age.</td>', 'Very appropriate take on the challenge - progress both mechanical and that brought about by age.', '2006-07-15 00:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623868, 362053, 30982, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I''d have no idea how this denotes progress.  It would be more effective, I think, if you''d used text or a pattern instead of a plain color.</td>', 'Without the title, I''d have no idea how this denotes progress.  It would be more effective, I think, if you''d used text or a pattern instead of a plain color.', '2006-07-15 00:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623874, 361962, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the idea - color is good (blue seems to do well on DPC) but the smoke is too much of a blob - it kinda overwhelms the picture a bit.</td>', 'I like the idea - color is good (blue seems to do well on DPC) but the smoke is too much of a blob - it kinda overwhelms the picture a bit.', '2006-07-15 00:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623877, 362312, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice juxtaposition.  I like the bird as a silhouette - makes it seem more overshadowed by the plane.</td>', 'Very nice juxtaposition.  I like the bird as a silhouette - makes it seem more overshadowed by the plane.', '2006-07-15 00:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623880, 362476, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oooh - pretty lights!  Good "black" to make the colors really shine; good crisp focus.  After the challenge, clone out the one lone light above the horizon on the left.</td>', 'Oooh - pretty lights!  Good "black" to make the colors really shine; good crisp focus.  After the challenge, clone out the one lone light above the horizon on the left.', '2006-07-15 00:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623884, 362347, 30982, '<td valign="top">These guys are pretty darn impressive with how fast they can move earth.  The angle makes several of them look a bit dead at first, and I kinda wish the one in the lower right could have been fully in frame.  Good response to the challenge.</td>', 'These guys are pretty darn impressive with how fast they can move earth.  The angle makes several of them look a bit dead at first, and I kinda wish the one in the lower right could have been fully in frame.  Good response to the challenge.', '2006-07-15 00:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623886, 362325, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simply adorable!  Very nice interpretation of the challenge, too.</td>', 'Simply adorable!  Very nice interpretation of the challenge, too.', '2006-07-15 00:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623891, 362508, 30982, '<td valign="top">Does meet challenge, quite well.  Would make a good stock photo, probably.  A bit too evenly spaced, maybe, but I do like the DOF and lighting used to relegate the older technology to the back.</td>', 'Does meet challenge, quite well.  Would make a good stock photo, probably.  A bit too evenly spaced, maybe, but I do like the DOF and lighting used to relegate the older technology to the back.', '2006-07-15 00:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623893, 361556, 30982, '<td valign="top">Does meet challenge.  Pretty good "stock" shot though it might have needed a bit more light on the face of the machine.</td>', 'Does meet challenge.  Pretty good "stock" shot though it might have needed a bit more light on the face of the machine.', '2006-07-15 00:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623897, 362213, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the sun coming through the side of the guy.  Geothermal energy?  It''s OK in B&amp;W but I wonder if it would be better in color.</td>', 'I like the sun coming through the side of the guy.  Geothermal energy?  It''s OK in B&W but I wonder if it would be better in color.', '2006-07-15 00:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623899, 362246, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good depiction of the fruit''s natural progress.</td>', 'Good depiction of the fruit''s natural progress.', '2006-07-15 00:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623900, 362109, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love it!  There''s enough light in the triangle to draw the eye almost immediately.  Very good interpretation of the challenge!</td>', 'LOL!  Love it!  There''s enough light in the triangle to draw the eye almost immediately.  Very good interpretation of the challenge!', '2006-07-15 00:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623902, 361608, 30982, '<td valign="top">A little weak in the challenge tie-in, but an interesting shot.</td>', 'A little weak in the challenge tie-in, but an interesting shot.', '2006-07-15 00:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623906, 360926, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the little old iron.  Does meet challenge.  Colors are a wee bit flat and the green spot on the iron does draw the eye, but I like the use of DOF, in this case to make the old more prominent than the "progressed" version.</td>', 'Love the little old iron.  Does meet challenge.  Colors are a wee bit flat and the green spot on the iron does draw the eye, but I like the use of DOF, in this case to make the old more prominent than the "progressed" version.', '2006-07-15 00:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623907, 362359, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good bug macro - sugar cube?  Tie-in to the challenge is a bit title-dependent.</td>', 'Good bug macro - sugar cube?  Tie-in to the challenge is a bit title-dependent.', '2006-07-15 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623911, 362194, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of the angles and nice way to show that the basics behind the idea (wheels, carriage) are still the same though the details have progressed considerably.</td>', 'Very effective use of the angles and nice way to show that the basics behind the idea (wheels, carriage) are still the same though the details have progressed considerably.', '2006-07-15 00:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623915, 362542, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge topic, but is weak in the technical aspect.  The sky is very pixelated, as though this was a very tight crop of a low resolution image.  This might be better if taken when the sun is in front of the building, rather than behind.</td>', 'Meets the challenge topic, but is weak in the technical aspect.  The sky is very pixelated, as though this was a very tight crop of a low resolution image.  This might be better if taken when the sun is in front of the building, rather than behind.', '2006-07-15 00:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623918, 359641, 30982, '<td valign="top">I see this as meeting the challenge inherently without the title.  Good pic of the little guy (gal?), too.</td>', 'I see this as meeting the challenge inherently without the title.  Good pic of the little guy (gal?), too.', '2006-07-15 00:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623926, 362449, 30982, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled!  The picture itself is well arranged compositionally but the straight on light is just a wee bit harsh, in my opinion.  Definitely meets the challenge.</td>', 'Aptly titled!  The picture itself is well arranged compositionally but the straight on light is just a wee bit harsh, in my opinion.  Definitely meets the challenge.', '2006-07-15 00:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623927, 362387, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s the headless climber!  Because of the lighting here, the climber''s head disappears into a shadow.  Maybe a closer shot from a different angle would be more pleasing but still get your point across.</td>', 'It''s the headless climber!  Because of the lighting here, the climber''s head disappears into a shadow.  Maybe a closer shot from a different angle would be more pleasing but still get your point across.', '2006-07-15 00:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623931, 362213, 61818, '<td valign="top">Get the bystander out of the shot and I think this would look 2x as good, exposure issues with the sun he is blocking notwithstanding.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Get the bystander out of the shot and I think this would look 2x as good, exposure issues with the sun he is blocking notwithstanding.  Nice photo.', '2006-07-15 00:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623932, 361151, 30982, '<td valign="top">The elements of the picture with the "HOMES" and the boat in comparison is good and gets your point across.  Can''t quite tell what''s going on with his head, though - maybe a magazine covering it?</td>', 'The elements of the picture with the "HOMES" and the boat in comparison is good and gets your point across.  Can''t quite tell what''s going on with his head, though - maybe a magazine covering it?', '2006-07-15 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623934, 362367, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture - love the diagonal formed and the colorful bokeh.  Definitely meets the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice capture - love the diagonal formed and the colorful bokeh.  Definitely meets the challenge.', '2006-07-15 00:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623938, 362510, 30982, '<td valign="top">Weird.  Very weird.  But interesting!  From a photographic perspective, I think I''d like the apple/fish thing a bit less on the center horizon.  Definitely meets the challenge!</td>', 'Weird.  Very weird.  But interesting!  From a photographic perspective, I think I''d like the apple/fish thing a bit less on the center horizon.  Definitely meets the challenge!', '2006-07-15 00:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623942, 361670, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure, not being well-versed in agronomy, but I doubt the hay bales are rolled by one guy and a pitchfork.  I could be wrong.  Composition is quite nice, but I''d prefer it either all in color, or all in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure, not being well-versed in agronomy, but I doubt the hay bales are rolled by one guy and a pitchfork.  I could be wrong.  Composition is quite nice, but I''d prefer it either all in color, or all in B&W.', '2006-07-15 00:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623945, 362524, 61818, '<td valign="top">Clever.  I like the background and how it gives the impression of flames, but overall the shot is a bit dark.  Bringing up those nice orange shades would really give it some kick I think.  Nice shot overall tho.</td>', 'Clever.  I like the background and how it gives the impression of flames, but overall the shot is a bit dark.  Bringing up those nice orange shades would really give it some kick I think.  Nice shot overall tho.', '2006-07-15 00:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623946, 362463, 30982, '<td valign="top">Signs of progress and/or destruction, though one often leads to the other.  Just a bit flat in the lighting/contrast.  Does meet challenge.</td>', 'Signs of progress and/or destruction, though one often leads to the other.  Just a bit flat in the lighting/contrast.  Does meet challenge.', '2006-07-15 00:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623947, 361491, 30982, '<td valign="top">How sad.</td>', 'How sad.', '2006-07-15 00:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623951, 362070, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunset - nice golden tones.  One could assume the challenge tie-in is the progress of the sun, perhaps.</td>', 'Pretty sunset - nice golden tones.  One could assume the challenge tie-in is the progress of the sun, perhaps.', '2006-07-15 00:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623976, 362475, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely macro.  For the challenge tie-in, I''ll assume with the title that this bug (which is very unusual) is progressing up the blade.</td>', 'Lovely macro.  For the challenge tie-in, I''ll assume with the title that this bug (which is very unusual) is progressing up the blade.', '2006-07-15 00:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623979, 362176, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice depiction of progress.  It''s a bit brightly exposed - might have been more effective it it could have been shot at a different time of day.</td>', 'Nice depiction of progress.  It''s a bit brightly exposed - might have been more effective it it could have been shot at a different time of day.', '2006-07-15 00:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623981, 362326, 30982, '<td valign="top">The average DPC voter in their 2-second view may completely miss the climber.  It''s very difficult to make him/her out against the background.</td>', 'The average DPC voter in their 2-second view may completely miss the climber.  It''s very difficult to make him/her out against the background.', '2006-07-15 00:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623984, 362188, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Interesting take on the challenge.  Bright pink and green isn''t my favorite color combo, though.</td>', 'LOL!  Interesting take on the challenge.  Bright pink and green isn''t my favorite color combo, though.', '2006-07-15 01:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623986, 362163, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Cute.  But they look very fake/plasticy.  I suspect a post-processing noise reduction technique may have caused this look.</td>', 'Heh!  Cute.  But they look very fake/plasticy.  I suspect a post-processing noise reduction technique may have caused this look.', '2006-07-15 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623990, 359184, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow - that''s one massive structure in the background.  Very well seen and quite appropriate to the challenge.</td>', 'Wow - that''s one massive structure in the background.  Very well seen and quite appropriate to the challenge.', '2006-07-15 01:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623996, 360089, 30982, '<td valign="top">But without it we wouldn''t have computers and you wouldn''t be able to download your digital pictures!  Lovely place to go take a picture.  Meets challenge well.</td>', 'But without it we wouldn''t have computers and you wouldn''t be able to download your digital pictures!  Lovely place to go take a picture.  Meets challenge well.', '2006-07-15 01:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2623997, 362040, 30982, '<td valign="top">Spare parts?  Meets challenge; good lighting - I like the shadows below the chips.  This would make an excellent stock photo, I bet.</td>', 'Spare parts?  Meets challenge; good lighting - I like the shadows below the chips.  This would make an excellent stock photo, I bet.', '2006-07-15 01:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
