(2625032, 362477, 62187, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s better then beers on the wall? An interesting photo and not something the everyday person sees.</td>', 'I guess it''s better then beers on the wall? An interesting photo and not something the everyday person sees.', '2006-07-15 17:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625033, 359184, 62187, '<td valign="top">Perfect in my book...captures the theme.</td>', 'Perfect in my book...captures the theme.', '2006-07-15 17:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625035, 362351, 59200, '<td valign="top">I love this image. Very simple but effective. Great work!</td>', 'I love this image. Very simple but effective. Great work!', '2006-07-15 17:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625036, 359184, 59200, '<td valign="top">I love this image. I love the perspective (and what its commenting on)I love the color contrast. I think the way you framed it so thee larger building takes up the entire frame is perfect. My only critique would be I wish you could see a little bit of the ground plane, it feels chopped off at the bottom.</td>', 'I love this image. I love the perspective (and what its commenting on)I love the color contrast. I think the way you framed it so thee larger building takes up the entire frame is perfect. My only critique would be I wish you could see a little bit of the ground plane, it feels chopped off at the bottom.', '2006-07-15 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625041, 360089, 62187, '<td valign="top">Sad but in inevetalbe...sometimes I hate progress.</td>', 'Sad but in inevetalbe...sometimes I hate progress.', '2006-07-15 18:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625045, 361562, 62187, '<td valign="top">A nice photo...to bad for size restrictions.</td>', 'A nice photo...to bad for size restrictions.', '2006-07-15 18:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625047, 361123, 59200, '<td valign="top">great image. I really like the subject and idea. Only critique would be the framing, it seems oddly cropped at the bottom.</td>', 'great image. I really like the subject and idea. Only critique would be the framing, it seems oddly cropped at the bottom.', '2006-07-15 18:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625050, 359557, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nailed the theme...bravo!</td>', 'Nailed the theme...bravo!', '2006-07-15 18:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625056, 362489, 62187, '<td valign="top">Super! The fact that you chose blue and white instead of black and white puts it not quite in the past with a touch of our present...well done.</td>', 'Super! The fact that you chose blue and white instead of black and white puts it not quite in the past with a touch of our present...well done.', '2006-07-15 18:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625061, 362151, 62187, '<td valign="top">Water pitcher bag might be another title.</td>', 'Water pitcher bag might be another title.', '2006-07-15 18:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625064, 361985, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but I like it!</td>', 'I don''t know why but I like it!', '2006-07-15 18:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625067, 361151, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is progress...maybe it''s the designer shoes? It''s irony and I like it.</td>', 'Not sure how this is progress...maybe it''s the designer shoes? It''s irony and I like it.', '2006-07-15 18:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625069, 362148, 62187, '<td valign="top">I guess it catches the theme perfectly and a nice job of egg stacking as well.</td>', 'I guess it catches the theme perfectly and a nice job of egg stacking as well.', '2006-07-15 18:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625071, 362098, 62187, '<td valign="top">A nice photo but I think it''s more degression the progress.</td>', 'A nice photo but I think it''s more degression the progress.', '2006-07-15 18:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625073, 362467, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow...I like it but it seems a little blurry in the upper left corner. Maybe it''s just me?</td>', 'Wow...I like it but it seems a little blurry in the upper left corner. Maybe it''s just me?', '2006-07-15 18:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625074, 360926, 62187, '<td valign="top">The future seems a little fuzzy to me.</td>', 'The future seems a little fuzzy to me.', '2006-07-15 18:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625076, 361868, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the crop but it''s an otherwise nice photo. Who needs fire hydrants when were moving towards non-combustable plastics and steel structures. Right?</td>', 'I''m not sure about the crop but it''s an otherwise nice photo. Who needs fire hydrants when were moving towards non-combustable plastics and steel structures. Right?', '2006-07-15 18:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625078, 362378, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yes...I like it! Perfect subject matter.</td>', 'Yes...I like it! Perfect subject matter.', '2006-07-15 18:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625082, 362527, 62187, '<td valign="top">The title hits a chord with me so I like it. Very nice close-up photo too!</td>', 'The title hits a chord with me so I like it. Very nice close-up photo too!', '2006-07-15 18:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625083, 362058, 62187, '<td valign="top">How can you not give a growing child a ''10''?</td>', 'How can you not give a growing child a ''10''?', '2006-07-15 18:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625087, 362486, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a B flat to me. Nice vantage point...got an airplane?</td>', 'Looks more like a B flat to me. Nice vantage point...got an airplane?', '2006-07-15 18:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625090, 361798, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see where it fits the ticket but it''s an interesting photo.</td>', 'I don''t really see where it fits the ticket but it''s an interesting photo.', '2006-07-15 18:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625091, 362053, 62187, '<td valign="top">Could have been centered better.</td>', 'Could have been centered better.', '2006-07-15 18:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625093, 362294, 62187, '<td valign="top">Oh no...another growing kid. I guess I''ll give it a ''10''.</td>', 'Oh no...another growing kid. I guess I''ll give it a ''10''.', '2006-07-15 18:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625094, 362326, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t know. What? Again, too bad for size restrictions.</td>', 'I don''t know. What? Again, too bad for size restrictions.', '2006-07-15 18:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625100, 360289, 62187, '<td valign="top">Once apon a time it may have been progress but maybe we''ll see this in use again if we''re not careful. It''s a nice photo.</td>', 'Once apon a time it may have been progress but maybe we''ll see this in use again if we''re not careful. It''s a nice photo.', '2006-07-15 18:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625102, 359150, 62187, '<td valign="top">Photo is too washed out for my liking. Seeds placed in an old hand with lots of wrinkles would have been awesome.</td>', 'Photo is too washed out for my liking. Seeds placed in an old hand with lots of wrinkles would have been awesome.', '2006-07-15 18:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625105, 359611, 62187, '<td valign="top">It looks like a clear day to me. Unless you mean the pollution of the buildings covering up what once was wild land? If that''s the case, good job!</td>', 'It looks like a clear day to me. Unless you mean the pollution of the buildings covering up what once was wild land? If that''s the case, good job!', '2006-07-15 18:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625111, 360795, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it...sorry.</td>', 'I don''t get it...sorry.', '2006-07-15 18:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625112, 361962, 62187, '<td valign="top">I guess that is certainly progress plus I like the colors.</td>', 'I guess that is certainly progress plus I like the colors.', '2006-07-15 18:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625116, 362403, 62187, '<td valign="top">The Ocean scares me...</td>', 'The Ocean scares me...', '2006-07-15 18:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625123, 362163, 62187, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just my eyes but it looks the bright areas have been over-sharpened while the midtones remained under-sharpened or soft. It certainly represents the theme though.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just my eyes but it looks the bright areas have been over-sharpened while the midtones remained under-sharpened or soft. It certainly represents the theme though.', '2006-07-15 18:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625129, 362246, 62187, '<td valign="top">You''re kidding me...they look gross...and I like Raspberries. Well, I used to anyway...thanks! It''s certainly a representation of progression though. (Some selective sharpening might be nice?)</td>', 'You''re kidding me...they look gross...and I like Raspberries. Well, I used to anyway...thanks! It''s certainly a representation of progression though. (Some selective sharpening might be nice?)', '2006-07-15 18:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625135, 362042, 62187, '<td valign="top">For me, a wider shot would have been nice and it looks back-lit. The idea is nice.</td>', 'For me, a wider shot would have been nice and it looks back-lit. The idea is nice.', '2006-07-15 18:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625137, 362099, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like the photo...</td>', 'I like the photo...', '2006-07-15 18:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625139, 360283, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...? Ok...!</td>', 'Hmmm...? Ok...!', '2006-07-15 18:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625146, 361459, 62187, '<td valign="top">I haven''t seen my great-great-great grandma in year! As perfect in essence as this photo is...it may be disturbing for some viewers even though it represents a natural fact of life.</td>', 'I haven''t seen my great-great-great grandma in year! As perfect in essence as this photo is...it may be disturbing for some viewers even though it represents a natural fact of life.', '2006-07-15 18:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625151, 361820, 62187, '<td valign="top">As opposed to a loin cloth and the only reason for going in the water is to hunt for food or bathe? Ok...</td>', 'As opposed to a loin cloth and the only reason for going in the water is to hunt for food or bathe? Ok...', '2006-07-15 18:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625153, 359879, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, yes there is...in the hair-styles for one - sitting to standing - and age of subjects. M-kay?</td>', 'Well, yes there is...in the hair-styles for one - sitting to standing - and age of subjects. M-kay?', '2006-07-15 18:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625155, 362345, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow...that''s weird so I like it.</td>', 'Wow...that''s weird so I like it.', '2006-07-15 18:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625157, 361556, 62187, '<td valign="top">Could be sharper and part of subject missing. Theme is right on.</td>', 'Could be sharper and part of subject missing. Theme is right on.', '2006-07-15 18:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625158, 362209, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t know...lighting a cigarette with your thumb is a thing of the past. I like the photo though...nice job.</td>', 'I don''t know...lighting a cigarette with your thumb is a thing of the past. I like the photo though...nice job.', '2006-07-15 18:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625160, 362325, 62187, '<td valign="top">I saw this commercial on TV! You can''t give kids anything less then a ''10''.</td>', 'I saw this commercial on TV! You can''t give kids anything less then a ''10''.', '2006-07-15 18:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625165, 361714, 62187, '<td valign="top">And now...Deep Thoughts by Jack Handy... (Nice photo)</td>', 'And now...Deep Thoughts by Jack Handy... (Nice photo)', '2006-07-15 18:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625166, 361955, 62187, '<td valign="top">And that''s the way it should be! Looks a little oversharpened to me.</td>', 'And that''s the way it should be! Looks a little oversharpened to me.', '2006-07-15 18:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625168, 362052, 62187, '<td valign="top">Unless you''re out of the service area.</td>', 'Unless you''re out of the service area.', '2006-07-15 18:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625170, 360209, 62187, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, it''s a beautiful picture.</td>', 'Unfortunately, it''s a beautiful picture.', '2006-07-15 18:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625172, 360968, 30982, '<td valign="top">Could also be called "Progress Forgotten" - once it was a progressive structure, I''m sure.  The color tones on this look a little off, and it may be a bit on the bright side.  This looks to be a great structure for pictures, though - I encourage you to try it at different times during the day (different light) and from different angles.</td>', 'Could also be called "Progress Forgotten" - once it was a progressive structure, I''m sure.  The color tones on this look a little off, and it may be a bit on the bright side.  This looks to be a great structure for pictures, though - I encourage you to try it at different times during the day (different light) and from different angles.', '2006-07-15 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625174, 360248, 30982, '<td valign="top">Don''t know about the progress part, but it''s a wonderful shot depcting friendship and comraderie!</td>', 'Don''t know about the progress part, but it''s a wonderful shot depcting friendship and comraderie!', '2006-07-15 18:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625178, 361320, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a bizarre flower!</td>', 'What a bizarre flower!', '2006-07-15 18:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625181, 362476, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice shot from the Stratosphere. Turn the other direction and you can see my house! However, this progress makes me sad in a way even though it pays my bills. When I was a kid this view would show absolutely nothing but a single road stretching out in the distance.</td>', 'Nice shot from the Stratosphere. Turn the other direction and you can see my house! However, this progress makes me sad in a way even though it pays my bills. When I was a kid this view would show absolutely nothing but a single road stretching out in the distance.', '2006-07-15 18:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625186, 362137, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the basic composition but would like just a touch more room at the bottom so he''s not walking right on the bottom of the frame.  Light is very interesting, and the one tree on the hill adds to the composition.  Not entirely sure about the challenge tie-in, but going with the theme implied by the challenge.</td>', 'I like the basic composition but would like just a touch more room at the bottom so he''s not walking right on the bottom of the frame.  Light is very interesting, and the one tree on the hill adds to the composition.  Not entirely sure about the challenge tie-in, but going with the theme implied by the challenge.', '2006-07-15 19:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625189, 360165, 62187, '<td valign="top">I get it...acoustic to electric. Nice job but a little out of focus to me.</td>', 'I get it...acoustic to electric. Nice job but a little out of focus to me.', '2006-07-15 19:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625191, 362070, 62187, '<td valign="top">...we progress towards another day?</td>', '...we progress towards another day?', '2006-07-15 19:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625192, 362253, 30982, '<td valign="top">Making good progress toward the goal. There''s an odd line across the top of the picture and overall seems quite flat and grainy.</td>', 'Making good progress toward the goal. There''s an odd line across the top of the picture and overall seems quite flat and grainy.', '2006-07-15 19:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625196, 362094, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a lily pad, albeit possibly a bit too centered.  Colors are very nice.  Not sure of the challenge tie-in.</td>', 'Nice shot of a lily pad, albeit possibly a bit too centered.  Colors are very nice.  Not sure of the challenge tie-in.', '2006-07-15 19:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625197, 361971, 62187, '<td valign="top">Photo not level otherwise great job.</td>', 'Photo not level otherwise great job.', '2006-07-15 19:02:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2625199, 362531, 30982, '<td valign="top">Aww, man!  That''s snail abuse!  Poor little fellow.  But a cute shot nd meets the challenge.</td>', 'Aww, man!  That''s snail abuse!  Poor little fellow.  But a cute shot nd meets the challenge.', '2006-07-15 19:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625203, 362229, 62187, '<td valign="top">Floating Bytes go bye.</td>', 'Floating Bytes go bye.', '2006-07-15 19:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625204, 362475, 62187, '<td valign="top">Bugs are creepy too...</td>', 'Bugs are creepy too...', '2006-07-15 19:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625205, 362035, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice statement.  Might have moved so that the poster was more to the left of the frame and you could see more of the houses under construction.  Definitely meets the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice statement.  Might have moved so that the poster was more to the left of the frame and you could see more of the houses under construction.  Definitely meets the challenge.', '2006-07-15 19:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625206, 360314, 62187, '<td valign="top">I must be illiterate and cain''t spel niether.</td>', 'I must be illiterate and cain''t spel niether.', '2006-07-15 19:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625210, 361140, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice butterfly picture!  Like the diagonals formed by the placement of the butterfly in the frame, and the ants are kinda cool.  Somewhat title-dependent tie-in to the challenge, though the butterfly signifies the end of the progression from the caterpillar stage.</td>', 'Very nice butterfly picture!  Like the diagonals formed by the placement of the butterfly in the frame, and the ants are kinda cool.  Somewhat title-dependent tie-in to the challenge, though the butterfly signifies the end of the progression from the caterpillar stage.', '2006-07-15 19:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625211, 362237, 30982, '<td valign="top">This to me does indeed meet the challenge - the "progress" is evident without the title.  Nice rich colors and tones.</td>', 'This to me does indeed meet the challenge - the "progress" is evident without the title.  Nice rich colors and tones.', '2006-07-15 19:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625216, 362403, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not seeing "progress" other than the boat is ''progressing'' in a forward direction.  The background detracts, if the boat is your focus, as it tends to blend in with it.  Overall colors seem a bit washed out and flat - lacking contrast.</td>', 'Not seeing "progress" other than the boat is ''progressing'' in a forward direction.  The background detracts, if the boat is your focus, as it tends to blend in with it.  Overall colors seem a bit washed out and flat - lacking contrast.', '2006-07-15 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625219, 362466, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - your model doesn''t look particularly thrilled about being photographed.  Good depiction of "progress".</td>', 'Heh - your model doesn''t look particularly thrilled about being photographed.  Good depiction of "progress".', '2006-07-15 19:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625223, 362058, 30982, '<td valign="top">Made me smile.  A very nice interpretation of "progress"; works well in monochrome.</td>', 'Made me smile.  A very nice interpretation of "progress"; works well in monochrome.', '2006-07-15 19:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625225, 362521, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and pose; lovely model.  Tie-in to the challenge is very title-dependent.</td>', 'Nice lighting and pose; lovely model.  Tie-in to the challenge is very title-dependent.', '2006-07-15 19:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625229, 361976, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is "progress".  A little harshly lit and background is not complimentary.</td>', 'Not sure how this is "progress".  A little harshly lit and background is not complimentary.', '2006-07-15 19:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625230, 360418, 30982, '<td valign="top">Having had a palm in my yard before, I "get" the connection to "progress" in that every year you have to cut these suckers back as they grow.  The blue is quite electric and some detail lost in the fronds, but it''s a kinda cool pic just the same.</td>', 'Having had a palm in my yard before, I "get" the connection to "progress" in that every year you have to cut these suckers back as they grow.  The blue is quite electric and some detail lost in the fronds, but it''s a kinda cool pic just the same.', '2006-07-15 19:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625231, 360802, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent sequence showing progression!  Nicely seen and very nicely captured.</td>', 'Excellent sequence showing progression!  Nicely seen and very nicely captured.', '2006-07-15 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625232, 362489, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition!  I do like it in monochromatic tones.</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition!  I do like it in monochromatic tones.', '2006-07-15 19:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625233, 359641, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hey, speak for yourself! My species came from genetically altered neolithic humaniods that were stranded here on Earth after their spaceship crash landed during their journey from a Star-Sytem in the Nunki Galaxy. Seriously, it''s a nice photo and fits the theme well. I wouldn''t have cropped the monkey''s elbow out thou. Well, I''ll be a monkey''s uncle...</td>', 'Hey, speak for yourself! My species came from genetically altered neolithic humaniods that were stranded here on Earth after their spaceship crash landed during their journey from a Star-Sytem in the Nunki Galaxy. Seriously, it''s a nice photo and fits the theme well. I wouldn''t have cropped the monkey''s elbow out thou. Well, I''ll be a monkey''s uncle...', '2006-07-15 19:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625237, 362151, 30982, '<td valign="top">People carried their cameras in buckets?  :-)  Basically meets the challenge, though, I''ll give you that.  Cleanly exposed, but somewhat uninspired composition.</td>', 'People carried their cameras in buckets?  :-)  Basically meets the challenge, though, I''ll give you that.  Cleanly exposed, but somewhat uninspired composition.', '2006-07-15 19:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625242, 359277, 62187, '<td valign="top">Gross...tomatoes...but a well thought-out photo.</td>', 'Gross...tomatoes...but a well thought-out photo.', '2006-07-15 19:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625245, 362140, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...? I like it!</td>', 'Hmmm...? I like it!', '2006-07-15 19:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625248, 362497, 62187, '<td valign="top">Chessey but the truth...I''m sure film will never die though.</td>', 'Chessey but the truth...I''m sure film will never die though.', '2006-07-15 19:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625250, 361459, 30982, '<td valign="top">To me, this picture says the progression of a human life is both a blessing and a curse.  I''ll assume this is a birthday party or other such celebration.  The honoree looks a bit sad and alone.</td>', 'To me, this picture says the progression of a human life is both a blessing and a curse.  I''ll assume this is a birthday party or other such celebration.  The honoree looks a bit sad and alone.', '2006-07-15 19:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625253, 360900, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo over-all (the cat''s a little dark to me thou) but I''m not getting it.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo over-all (the cat''s a little dark to me thou) but I''m not getting it.', '2006-07-15 19:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625254, 362500, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this works quite well, and I suspect its a combination of the lighting which serves to make the gentlemen blend more with his surroundings (which adds to the "message", in a way) and the colors.</td>', 'I think this works quite well, and I suspect its a combination of the lighting which serves to make the gentlemen blend more with his surroundings (which adds to the "message", in a way) and the colors.', '2006-07-15 19:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625256, 362134, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like your photo and message a lot but I think the post-editing workflow could have been better. I still give it a ''9''.</td>', 'I like your photo and message a lot but I think the post-editing workflow could have been better. I still give it a ''9''.', '2006-07-15 19:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625259, 362162, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like they''re trying to put in some sort of walkway?  Meets challenge, but the composition isn''t particularly interesting.  The blue barricade things compete with the vertical sign and pole for attention, and the viewer isn''t exactly sure what the subject is or should be.</td>', 'Looks like they''re trying to put in some sort of walkway?  Meets challenge, but the composition isn''t particularly interesting.  The blue barricade things compete with the vertical sign and pole for attention, and the viewer isn''t exactly sure what the subject is or should be.', '2006-07-15 19:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625261, 361356, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yes, that''s progress (unless he''s repelling). I think the photo would have been perfect if either the subject of the climber would have been in sunlight or, in total silouette.</td>', 'Yes, that''s progress (unless he''s repelling). I think the photo would have been perfect if either the subject of the climber would have been in sunlight or, in total silouette.', '2006-07-15 19:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625263, 360205, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice...!</td>', 'Nice...!', '2006-07-15 19:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625269, 362203, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice subject matter but could be focused or sharpened better.</td>', 'Nice subject matter but could be focused or sharpened better.', '2006-07-15 19:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
