(2625493, 359868, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gosh, this has never been done before!  (Just teasing...)  Do have to say I don''t really see the connection to "Progress", though.</td>', 'Gosh, this has never been done before!  (Just teasing...)  Do have to say I don''t really see the connection to "Progress", though.', '2006-07-15 21:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625496, 362462, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clever idea for the challenge!  He looks a little plasticky, on his head in particular.</td>', 'Clever idea for the challenge!  He looks a little plasticky, on his head in particular.', '2006-07-15 21:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625497, 360805, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kind of a weird glow around the windmill, but I guess that lends to the concept of "power".  Does meet the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of a weird glow around the windmill, but I guess that lends to the concept of "power".  Does meet the challenge.', '2006-07-15 21:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625498, 362537, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really good aquarium pic! Love the little crab guy - hoping the fish doesn''t eat him!  Very good color and focus.</td>', 'Really good aquarium pic! Love the little crab guy - hoping the fish doesn''t eat him!  Very good color and focus.', '2006-07-15 21:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625500, 362042, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wiretapping or cameras?  Very good idea for the challenge, but the picture is a bit on the small side.  If possible, crop and rotate so the pole is vertical and not leaning out of the frame.</td>', 'Wiretapping or cameras?  Very good idea for the challenge, but the picture is a bit on the small side.  If possible, crop and rotate so the pole is vertical and not leaning out of the frame.', '2006-07-15 21:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625509, 362484, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  A bit uninteresting as presented, thogh the bits of green add a spark.  This would probably have more impact if shown in context - is the ground being cleared to build something?</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  A bit uninteresting as presented, thogh the bits of green add a spark.  This would probably have more impact if shown in context - is the ground being cleared to build something?', '2006-07-15 21:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625511, 359936, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang that thing is ugly!  The nest looks too perfect in a way, like a woven basket, and seems seriously clean to be a bird''s nest.  Good composition, with the inclusion of the greenery behind.</td>', 'Dang that thing is ugly!  The nest looks too perfect in a way, like a woven basket, and seems seriously clean to be a bird''s nest.  Good composition, with the inclusion of the greenery behind.', '2006-07-15 21:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625514, 362025, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yep, get ''em started when they''re young!  Since she''s looking to the left of the picture, you could move her a bit more to the right.  Not sure about the pink blanket or the other green thing - they seem a bit extraneous.</td>', 'Yep, get ''em started when they''re young!  Since she''s looking to the left of the picture, you could move her a bit more to the right.  Not sure about the pink blanket or the other green thing - they seem a bit extraneous.', '2006-07-15 21:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625517, 361488, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very clever!  Definitely meets the challenge.</td>', 'Very clever!  Definitely meets the challenge.', '2006-07-15 21:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625519, 361985, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, but without the electricity, there would be no computers and no photography!  I actually like the light by the house - it''s a nice echo to the moon in this shot.</td>', 'Ah, but without the electricity, there would be no computers and no photography!  I actually like the light by the house - it''s a nice echo to the moon in this shot.', '2006-07-15 21:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625520, 362467, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot for Perspective - shows just how huge this structure is!  Also appears that they''ve made progress in fixing the place.</td>', 'Great shot for Perspective - shows just how huge this structure is!  Also appears that they''ve made progress in fixing the place.', '2006-07-15 21:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625521, 359611, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice cityscape.  Not sure where you''re going with the title but I do like the shot.</td>', 'Nice cityscape.  Not sure where you''re going with the title but I do like the shot.', '2006-07-15 21:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625522, 360077, 30982, '<td valign="top">Probably not a photo the authors would use to advertise their book, but it does get the point of your title across.  The overprocessing on the chair is kinda cool.</td>', 'Probably not a photo the authors would use to advertise their book, but it does get the point of your title across.  The overprocessing on the chair is kinda cool.', '2006-07-15 21:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625523, 360795, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.. I like the desat to highlight the subject.  Just not entirely sure I buy into the "Progress" part.</td>', 'Hmmm.. I like the desat to highlight the subject.  Just not entirely sure I buy into the "Progress" part.', '2006-07-15 21:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625528, 362486, 30982, '<td valign="top">Liked this one when I went through the thumbnails - like it even better full size.  Very nice capture showing various aspects of "progress" - trains, cars, towns - and even the trees that either remain or have been planted.  Excellent capture - nice statement that progress isn''t all bad and can in fact be quite lovely (or at least that''s how I see it.)</td>', 'Liked this one when I went through the thumbnails - like it even better full size.  Very nice capture showing various aspects of "progress" - trains, cars, towns - and even the trees that either remain or have been planted.  Excellent capture - nice statement that progress isn''t all bad and can in fact be quite lovely (or at least that''s how I see it.)', '2006-07-15 21:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625560, 359620, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  The windmill is such that it''s hard to see the blades, which I think are pretty impressive.  I do like the sun flare, but overall the picture is a little flat contrast-wise, in my opinion.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  The windmill is such that it''s hard to see the blades, which I think are pretty impressive.  I do like the sun flare, but overall the picture is a little flat contrast-wise, in my opinion.', '2006-07-15 21:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625562, 360527, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not quite "progress" to me, though you did get the blessing/curse part.  Nice shot of the blooms and I like the brick in the background.</td>', 'Not quite "progress" to me, though you did get the blessing/curse part.  Nice shot of the blooms and I like the brick in the background.', '2006-07-15 21:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625564, 359277, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice progression depicted.  Only quibble is the bluish reflection on the jar and only because the color seems kinda odd.</td>', 'Very nice progression depicted.  Only quibble is the bluish reflection on the jar and only because the color seems kinda odd.', '2006-07-15 21:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625565, 362515, 30982, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh out loud!  A delightful shot - the expression makes it, of course, but the angles are good, too.</td>', 'Made me laugh out loud!  A delightful shot - the expression makes it, of course, but the angles are good, too.', '2006-07-15 21:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625566, 361952, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great depiction of "progress", to me.  Love the tones and DOF chosen for this.</td>', 'Great depiction of "progress", to me.  Love the tones and DOF chosen for this.', '2006-07-15 21:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625567, 361151, 60583, '<td valign="top">I don''t think he really grasps the "TRY US!" slogan.  Nice ironic image.</td>', 'I don''t think he really grasps the "TRY US!" slogan.  Nice ironic image.', '2006-07-15 21:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625570, 362052, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice sort of artsy/ad-like depiction of the progression of telephone technology.  Not sure of the 24/7 part, though, since I thought all phones worked 24/7.</td>', 'Nice sort of artsy/ad-like depiction of the progression of telephone technology.  Not sure of the 24/7 part, though, since I thought all phones worked 24/7.', '2006-07-15 21:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625571, 361952, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.   It has such a strong composition, and I love the sepia look.    Great job!</td>', 'I love this photo.   It has such a strong composition, and I love the sepia look.    Great job!', '2006-07-15 21:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625572, 361053, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the machinery with the pristine, quiet nature of the house of worship.  Toning is lovely.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the machinery with the pristine, quiet nature of the house of worship.  Toning is lovely.', '2006-07-15 21:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625573, 360357, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Doris Day to Green Day and change of format.  Very appropriate for the challenge, and red and black always work well together.</td>', 'Very nice!  Doris Day to Green Day and change of format.  Very appropriate for the challenge, and red and black always work well together.', '2006-07-15 21:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625574, 362489, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is great.  A very well done portrayal of progress.  I like the blue tones too.</td>', 'This is great.  A very well done portrayal of progress.  I like the blue tones too.', '2006-07-15 21:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625576, 359557, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the challenge - works for me even though the subject''s back is to the camera.  I''m sure you''ll get comments on "iron the sheet" though.</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the challenge - works for me even though the subject''s back is to the camera.  I''m sure you''ll get comments on "iron the sheet" though.', '2006-07-15 21:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625578, 362090, 62187, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo!</td>', 'Awesome photo!', '2006-07-15 22:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625584, 360248, 24454, '<td valign="top">I just love this one.  It''s simple, and so candid and sweet.   You really get the feeling that you''re being let in on intimate friendship -- gives you a sense of belonging.  Great job.   Plus, I love baseball photos :)</td>', 'I just love this one.  It''s simple, and so candid and sweet.   You really get the feeling that you''re being let in on intimate friendship -- gives you a sense of belonging.  Great job.   Plus, I love baseball photos :)', '2006-07-15 22:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625587, 362475, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this one.     I think it''s an awesome depiction of progress.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love this one.     I think it''s an awesome depiction of progress.  Good luck!', '2006-07-15 22:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625591, 360988, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge; looks like the student did pretty well, too.  Well photographed for what it is; probably not standalone picture outside the challenge, though.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge; looks like the student did pretty well, too.  Well photographed for what it is; probably not standalone picture outside the challenge, though.', '2006-07-15 22:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625595, 362512, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice look!  Title gives the challenge tie-in or it might not be very clear.  Unless you interpret the fat she''s not paying attention means the game is not progressing...</td>', 'Nice look!  Title gives the challenge tie-in or it might not be very clear.  Unless you interpret the fat she''s not paying attention means the game is not progressing...', '2006-07-15 22:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625596, 362035, 60583, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  It makes me wonder how the workers feel with this giant girl looking down and scolding them as they go to work every day.</td>', 'Wonderful.  It makes me wonder how the workers feel with this giant girl looking down and scolding them as they go to work every day.', '2006-07-15 22:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625598, 361973, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh - focus is a little soft on the bugs.  Not sure about the challenge tie-in, though.</td>', 'Nice bokeh - focus is a little soft on the bugs.  Not sure about the challenge tie-in, though.', '2006-07-15 22:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625601, 361562, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed night shot - I especially like the clouds which add a bit of texture to the scene.  Does indeed meet the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely exposed night shot - I especially like the clouds which add a bit of texture to the scene.  Does indeed meet the challenge.', '2006-07-15 22:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625602, 362515, 60583, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like this.  Definately worth playing around with post-challenge.  I bet it would look real good with the towl-rack edited out and a few spots zapped out. Nice work.</td>', 'Wow, I really like this.  Definately worth playing around with post-challenge.  I bet it would look real good with the towl-rack edited out and a few spots zapped out. Nice work.', '2006-07-15 22:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625616, 360894, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  Rich colors on the cherries, nice contrast from the leaves.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  Rich colors on the cherries, nice contrast from the leaves.', '2006-07-15 22:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625619, 362203, 30982, '<td valign="top">A common site just about everywhere these days.  Meets challenge; a pretty good capture though it seems just a bit soft, ie could benefit from a little sharpening, maybe.</td>', 'A common site just about everywhere these days.  Meets challenge; a pretty good capture though it seems just a bit soft, ie could benefit from a little sharpening, maybe.', '2006-07-15 22:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625628, 362345, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can see this as progress - nice interpretation.  I like the dress up front in focus and the bride behind blurred, but she''s a little too dark, I think, and for some reason it seems a bit unbalanced.  Not sure whether you need her over a bit more to the right to align better with the diagonal from the hanger, maybe?</td>', 'I can see this as progress - nice interpretation.  I like the dress up front in focus and the bride behind blurred, but she''s a little too dark, I think, and for some reason it seems a bit unbalanced.  Not sure whether you need her over a bit more to the right to align better with the diagonal from the hanger, maybe?', '2006-07-15 22:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625629, 360899, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice find, where it still resembles the seed pod from which it came.</td>', 'Nice find, where it still resembles the seed pod from which it came.', '2006-07-15 22:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625630, 361406, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good catch and works well for the challenge.  I like the blue, too.</td>', 'Good catch and works well for the challenge.  I like the blue, too.', '2006-07-15 22:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625632, 361851, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Definitely meets the challenge.  Lighting on her face is very nice, particularly her eye.</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Definitely meets the challenge.  Lighting on her face is very nice, particularly her eye.', '2006-07-15 22:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625637, 360205, 60583, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! This image feels classically timeless... does that make sense?  Either way, it feels very Diane Arbus-ish.</td>', 'Beautiful! This image feels classically timeless... does that make sense?  Either way, it feels very Diane Arbus-ish.', '2006-07-15 22:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625639, 361402, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts in the slate gray earth, the yellow equipment, and the blue sky.  Might be a bit better compositionally if the John Deere weren''t dead center - then again, might not.  It''s actually pretty balanced this way.  Meets challenge well.</td>', 'Nice contrasts in the slate gray earth, the yellow equipment, and the blue sky.  Might be a bit better compositionally if the John Deere weren''t dead center - then again, might not.  It''s actually pretty balanced this way.  Meets challenge well.', '2006-07-15 22:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625658, 360527, 62187, '<td valign="top">Am I still in the "Progess" catagory? Maybe I''m not getting it...sorry. Well, yes, now I get it! Thanks Joe for the wonderful photo and straightening me out.</td>', 'Am I still in the "Progess" catagory? Maybe I''m not getting it...sorry. Well, yes, now I get it! Thanks Joe for the wonderful photo and straightening me out.', '2006-07-15 22:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
