(2625900, 362542, 38496, '<td valign="top">The colors are a little flat, and the picture lacks any real interest.    The astronaut could be a little sharper, ane there is pixilation in the sky. The lines of the building are nice, though, as is the reflection in the window.</td>', 'The colors are a little flat, and the picture lacks any real interest.    The astronaut could be a little sharper, ane there is pixilation in the sky. The lines of the building are nice, though, as is the reflection in the window.', '2006-07-16 00:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625904, 361976, 38496, '<td valign="top">toys aren''t overly interestin, a real baby would have had more impact.  The light behind the doll is distracting.  Cute idea, though.</td>', 'toys aren''t overly interestin, a real baby would have had more impact.  The light behind the doll is distracting.  Cute idea, though.', '2006-07-16 00:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625911, 360335, 38496, '<td valign="top">Nice sky picture.  Maybe just a wee bit of a shoe horn for progress.  Love the colors in the clouds, though.</td>', 'Nice sky picture.  Maybe just a wee bit of a shoe horn for progress.  Love the colors in the clouds, though.', '2006-07-16 00:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625914, 361568, 38496, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-07-16 00:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625917, 362351, 38496, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually care much for the barbed wire shots, but this one is really nice.  I like the contrast of the green background and the brown and silber wire.  And the progression of the plant along the wire is very effective.</td>', 'I don''t usually care much for the barbed wire shots, but this one is really nice.  I like the contrast of the green background and the brown and silber wire.  And the progression of the plant along the wire is very effective.', '2006-07-16 00:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625950, 360926, 61030, '<td valign="top">I think that maybe the newer iron should have been the object in focus since the challenge is about progress, that way it shows the new iron replacing the old one. Just a thought.</td>', 'I think that maybe the newer iron should have been the object in focus since the challenge is about progress, that way it shows the new iron replacing the old one. Just a thought.', '2006-07-16 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625956, 362326, 61030, '<td valign="top">The person needs to be focused on more in this photo.  For me, the amount of rock in the photo becomes too distracting.</td>', 'The person needs to be focused on more in this photo.  For me, the amount of rock in the photo becomes too distracting.', '2006-07-16 01:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625959, 362148, 61030, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this even more if I could see all of the eggs. I like the composition though.</td>', 'I would have liked this even more if I could see all of the eggs. I like the composition though.', '2006-07-16 01:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625967, 359277, 61030, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, but it seems a little tilted/not straight.</td>', 'I really like the composition, but it seems a little tilted/not straight.', '2006-07-16 01:14:55.000000', NULL, 1);
