(2626515, 361320, 31133, '<td valign="top">Is this one of those special flowers that only blooms once every so many years and then it lasts for one day? I think I read about some kind of flower like that. It definitely looks worth the wait! I might prefer sharper focus on the center and possibly some paper or something behind the flower to avoid the blown highlight issue. The colors are gorgeous.</td>', 'Is this one of those special flowers that only blooms once every so many years and then it lasts for one day? I think I read about some kind of flower like that. It definitely looks worth the wait! I might prefer sharper focus on the center and possibly some paper or something behind the flower to avoid the blown highlight issue. The colors are gorgeous.', '2006-07-16 10:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626517, 362253, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!', '2006-07-16 10:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626521, 362500, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful picture. The light is quite harsh, but maybe that''s what you were after to emphasize the harsh life. I can imagine that black &amp; white might work well in this image.</td>', 'This is a powerful picture. The light is quite harsh, but maybe that''s what you were after to emphasize the harsh life. I can imagine that black & white might work well in this image.', '2006-07-16 10:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626522, 361406, 31133, '<td valign="top">Great! What perfect composition - every bit of it contributes to your message (excuse the pun). This is my favorite of the 20 or so images I''ve voted on so far and likely to be my fave of ''em all. Good job.</td>', 'Great! What perfect composition - every bit of it contributes to your message (excuse the pun). This is my favorite of the 20 or so images I''ve voted on so far and likely to be my fave of ''em all. Good job.', '2006-07-16 10:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626524, 362326, 31133, '<td valign="top">Too bad you weren''t able to get closer to the climber, because I think this could''ve been very powerful. Technically, it looks pretty good. If it were my image, I might crop just to the right of the climber, near the bushes. Might help bring him out a little more.</td>', 'Too bad you weren''t able to get closer to the climber, because I think this could''ve been very powerful. Technically, it looks pretty good. If it were my image, I might crop just to the right of the climber, near the bushes. Might help bring him out a little more.', '2006-07-16 10:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626528, 361714, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea to use the entire allowed 640 pixels on one side. A larger image size can sometimes make it appear more dynamic. I think you captured the water beautifully (!!) - its spray looks so smooth and I like all the greenery surrounding it. Also to make the image more dynamic, you might consider cropping a bet out of the left, so the waterfall is positioned more in the left third. Nice job - and I hope you don''t mind my comments.</td>', 'It''s a good idea to use the entire allowed 640 pixels on one side. A larger image size can sometimes make it appear more dynamic. I think you captured the water beautifully (!!) - its spray looks so smooth and I like all the greenery surrounding it. Also to make the image more dynamic, you might consider cropping a bet out of the left, so the waterfall is positioned more in the left third. Nice job - and I hope you don''t mind my comments.', '2006-07-16 10:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626532, 362542, 31133, '<td valign="top">The concept is okay, but the image quality is suffering for some reason. I like the reflections in the building windows.</td>', 'The concept is okay, but the image quality is suffering for some reason. I like the reflections in the building windows.', '2006-07-16 10:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626534, 362468, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful exposure, ooooooh! The reflection of the clouds is dreamlike. I actually prefer the reflection to the actual clouds - would be awesome with just the wetland, but I guess you have to get the powerlines in there too to meet the challenge :-) The mountain in the background adds a nice bit of interest.</td>', 'Beautiful exposure, ooooooh! The reflection of the clouds is dreamlike. I actually prefer the reflection to the actual clouds - would be awesome with just the wetland, but I guess you have to get the powerlines in there too to meet the challenge :-) The mountain in the background adds a nice bit of interest.', '2006-07-16 10:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626546, 359150, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is so subtle and wonderful! I love how the hand fills the entire frame. The title seems a stretch, but I don''t place any weight in that at all. You''re getting a high score from me, and if you get what you deserve, you''ll have many, many more high scores. I love the counterpoint of the lines between the fingers and the spheres of the seeds. This is a calming image.</td>', 'This is so subtle and wonderful! I love how the hand fills the entire frame. The title seems a stretch, but I don''t place any weight in that at all. You''re getting a high score from me, and if you get what you deserve, you''ll have many, many more high scores. I love the counterpoint of the lines between the fingers and the spheres of the seeds. This is a calming image.', '2006-07-16 10:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626553, 361402, 31133, '<td valign="top">The centering works well here.</td>', 'The centering works well here.', '2006-07-16 11:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
