(2630124, 362058, 24073, '<td valign="top">Somethings just remind me of being a kid, and that feeling of freedom we never knew we had.  This is one of them.  Very nice!  I am seeing quite a bit of noise though.</td>', 'Somethings just remind me of being a kid, and that feeling of freedom we never knew we had.  This is one of them.  Very nice!  I am seeing quite a bit of noise though.', '2006-07-17 14:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630141, 360283, 24073, '<td valign="top">I do like the outside of the box thinking on this one, and I will score well for that.  The photo I don''t think is giving off the right mood for the context though. I think the grain takes the grace out of it, and its something that I''m longing for sort of.  I dont know exactly I hope this helps though.  It just seems like elements are working against each other.</td>', 'I do like the outside of the box thinking on this one, and I will score well for that.  The photo I don''t think is giving off the right mood for the context though. I think the grain takes the grace out of it, and its something that I''m longing for sort of.  I dont know exactly I hope this helps though.  It just seems like elements are working against each other.', '2006-07-17 14:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630145, 361971, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  I cant help to think though how this would look if somebody held up a black backdrop behind the two subjects.</td>', 'Very cute!  I cant help to think though how this would look if somebody held up a black backdrop behind the two subjects.', '2006-07-17 14:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
