(2630157, 362484, 24073, '<td valign="top">You got my attention, and I want so bad for this photo to make a statement.  However, the flat neutral colors are only going to draw in your sentimentalists &lt;---if that is even a word.  Agreeable people within the context of the photo.</td>', 'You got my attention, and I want so bad for this photo to make a statement.  However, the flat neutral colors are only going to draw in your sentimentalists <---if that is even a word.  Agreeable people within the context of the photo.', '2006-07-17 14:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630174, 361633, 24073, '<td valign="top">I''ll score higher, if I can have it. LOL.  Good execution, meets the challenge, lacks creativity, but not enough to take away a point.  Depth is nice, the colors work, the border is splendid, and your lighting is fabulous.  This photo should walk into the top 15% no problem.  GL.</td>', 'I''ll score higher, if I can have it. LOL.  Good execution, meets the challenge, lacks creativity, but not enough to take away a point.  Depth is nice, the colors work, the border is splendid, and your lighting is fabulous.  This photo should walk into the top 15% no problem.  GL.', '2006-07-17 14:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630180, 362326, 24073, '<td valign="top">Boy I would like to be him.  Your photo doesn''t have any pop to it.  Forgettable in a way, but still nice.  It strikes me as average.  I hope this helps.  GL.</td>', 'Boy I would like to be him.  Your photo doesn''t have any pop to it.  Forgettable in a way, but still nice.  It strikes me as average.  I hope this helps.  GL.', '2006-07-17 14:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
