(2630213, 362090, 24073, '<td valign="top">You found a terrific way to make a very busy distracting photo appealing.  I will be studying this one for a while.  Great job.  GL.<br/> <br/>Owe wow there is hidden images in the sky too.  (reflections), too wierd.  Its like electrical currents conflicing with spirits.  I like it alot.  GL.</td>', 'You found a terrific way to make a very busy distracting photo appealing.  I will be studying this one for a while.  Great job.  GL. Owe wow there is hidden images in the sky too.  (reflections), too wierd.  Its like electrical currents conflicing with spirits.  I like it alot.  GL.', '2006-07-17 15:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630214, 360335, 45790, '<td valign="top">I''ve always liked backlit cloud shots. This has the added effect of apparently being near dusk/dawn.</td>', 'I''ve always liked backlit cloud shots. This has the added effect of apparently being near dusk/dawn.', '2006-07-17 15:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
