(2630291, 362325, 27137, '<td valign="top">good idea, nicely made, i would only cut the top of the kids head as there is too much space for the eye to wonder and there i nothing to see up there 7</td>', 'good idea, nicely made, i would only cut the top of the kids head as there is too much space for the eye to wonder and there i nothing to see up there 7', '2006-07-17 15:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630292, 362449, 45790, '<td valign="top">From simply a technology point of view, your picture raises more questions than it answers, and could benefit from fewer (or better choice of) memory devices. For instance, the Sandisk 2GB CF is certainly progress from the Lexar 256MB, but what is the reationship between the PNY 1GB SD, at half the physical size, to the 2GB Sandisk? And perhaps the mini-SD, although small capacity, represents the future? And how does the hard disk relate?<br/> <br/>Photographically, the composition is fine, but you may be a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'From simply a technology point of view, your picture raises more questions than it answers, and could benefit from fewer (or better choice of) memory devices. For instance, the Sandisk 2GB CF is certainly progress from the Lexar 256MB, but what is the reationship between the PNY 1GB SD, at half the physical size, to the 2GB Sandisk? And perhaps the mini-SD, although small capacity, represents the future? And how does the hard disk relate? Photographically, the composition is fine, but you may be a bit oversharpened.', '2006-07-17 15:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630308, 362510, 24073, '<td valign="top">An elite photo that digs deep.  Most intriguing is the fact that you come up with this creativity in the progress challenge.  At this point Im confident that your photographic skills further exceed the need to be complimented by others, so I wont.  However I would like to add you to my favs list.  GL.</td>', 'An elite photo that digs deep.  Most intriguing is the fact that you come up with this creativity in the progress challenge.  At this point Im confident that your photographic skills further exceed the need to be complimented by others, so I wont.  However I would like to add you to my favs list.  GL.', '2006-07-17 15:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630350, 361952, 24073, '<td valign="top">The execution of this photo is your savior here.  IMHO, I don''t think the creativity is great, I think the subject is boring, and it really doesn''t adequately connect to the challenge.  However the execution, and overall image here is extraordinary.  The mood is great, the image is sharp, and it stands out.  Im giving it an 8 on shear execution.  Great job. GL.<br/> <br/>I may even come back to bump this up.</td>', 'The execution of this photo is your savior here.  IMHO, I don''t think the creativity is great, I think the subject is boring, and it really doesn''t adequately connect to the challenge.  However the execution, and overall image here is extraordinary.  The mood is great, the image is sharp, and it stands out.  Im giving it an 8 on shear execution.  Great job. GL. I may even come back to bump this up.', '2006-07-17 15:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630355, 362213, 24073, '<td valign="top">Splendid execution, definately stands out, and connects the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Splendid execution, definately stands out, and connects the challenge perfectly.', '2006-07-17 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630357, 359936, 24073, '<td valign="top">you really nailed some colors here, without going overboard.  Nice, very nice.  GL.</td>', 'you really nailed some colors here, without going overboard.  Nice, very nice.  GL.', '2006-07-17 15:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
