(2632086, 360165, 62249, '<td valign="top">Foreground guitar isn''t bad. A little overexposed in spots, but still pops out well. Background guitar isn''t rich enough. Too light in lower left corner.</td>', 'Foreground guitar isn''t bad. A little overexposed in spots, but still pops out well. Background guitar isn''t rich enough. Too light in lower left corner.', '2006-07-18 03:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632092, 360357, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice red/black contrast and good concept. Good highlights on MP3 player without being overexposed. Nice lighting on vinyl, although what is the cause of the distinct straight line going from label to lower right?</td>', 'Nice red/black contrast and good concept. Good highlights on MP3 player without being overexposed. Nice lighting on vinyl, although what is the cause of the distinct straight line going from label to lower right?', '2006-07-18 03:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632095, 362131, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the colorful scaffolding. Hard to expose this kind of shot correctly, and this one comes pretty close. A little blown out in the highlights.</td>', 'I like the colorful scaffolding. Hard to expose this kind of shot correctly, and this one comes pretty close. A little blown out in the highlights.', '2006-07-18 03:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632097, 361556, 62249, '<td valign="top">Overly bright area on counter is distracting. But soft focus on machine makes it seem less scary.</td>', 'Overly bright area on counter is distracting. But soft focus on machine makes it seem less scary.', '2006-07-18 03:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632101, 362347, 62249, '<td valign="top">I love watching ants. Photo is a bit overexposed, and I''d like a tighter composition, but it''s hard to get the little suckers to pose...</td>', 'I love watching ants. Photo is a bit overexposed, and I''d like a tighter composition, but it''s hard to get the little suckers to pose...', '2006-07-18 03:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632103, 359557, 62249, '<td valign="top">Right sleeve is a bit washed out, but overall a nice composition. Hair looks nice.</td>', 'Right sleeve is a bit washed out, but overall a nice composition. Hair looks nice.', '2006-07-18 03:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632105, 362058, 62249, '<td valign="top">Would like this slightly darker overall.</td>', 'Would like this slightly darker overall.', '2006-07-18 03:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632112, 361151, 62249, '<td valign="top">Okay, ironic juxtaposition of "Homes" vending box and homeless person. But not immediately clear how it represents progress. Lack of progress, perhaps. Try a tighter crop to eliminate  some of the right side of the photo. Might make it easier to adjust brightness/contrast on blanket.</td>', 'Okay, ironic juxtaposition of "Homes" vending box and homeless person. But not immediately clear how it represents progress. Lack of progress, perhaps. Try a tighter crop to eliminate  some of the right side of the photo. Might make it easier to adjust brightness/contrast on blanket.', '2006-07-18 03:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632119, 362468, 62249, '<td valign="top">To make a stronger commentary (to match the title), needs more emphasis on the power lines.</td>', 'To make a stronger commentary (to match the title), needs more emphasis on the power lines.', '2006-07-18 03:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632128, 362213, 62249, '<td valign="top">Model is a little stiff looking, and the sun peeking between his arm and torso kinda makes him look like a Hollywood space alien. The billowing smoke (steam?) is interesting, and I like this in black and white.</td>', 'Model is a little stiff looking, and the sun peeking between his arm and torso kinda makes him look like a Hollywood space alien. The billowing smoke (steam?) is interesting, and I like this in black and white.', '2006-07-18 03:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632132, 360283, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lots of background noise in the image, but it''s an interesting concept. Would make a good greeting card idea.</td>', 'Lots of background noise in the image, but it''s an interesting concept. Would make a good greeting card idea.', '2006-07-18 03:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632139, 359232, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice exposure, nice social commentary.</td>', 'Nice composition, nice exposure, nice social commentary.', '2006-07-18 03:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632148, 362208, 62249, '<td valign="top">Looks like one of those inspirational posters. Just the right amount of glisten on the snail.</td>', 'Looks like one of those inspirational posters. Just the right amount of glisten on the snail.', '2006-07-18 03:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632157, 360926, 62249, '<td valign="top">Setup is a little too contrived, and the patterned surface catches my eye more than the irons.</td>', 'Setup is a little too contrived, and the patterned surface catches my eye more than the irons.', '2006-07-18 03:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632162, 362367, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, interesting background, sharply focused and well exposed sticks.</td>', 'Nice capture, interesting background, sharply focused and well exposed sticks.', '2006-07-18 03:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632174, 361491, 62249, '<td valign="top">Awww....<br/> <br/>Crop photo to lose the wrist.</td>', 'Awww.... Crop photo to lose the wrist.', '2006-07-18 03:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632177, 362515, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, good exposure, fun expression on face. And feed that kid some Wheaties...</td>', 'Interesting angle, good exposure, fun expression on face. And feed that kid some Wheaties...', '2006-07-18 03:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632179, 362140, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the blue/yellow in the top half of the photo. Maybe crop out some of the gray foreground.</td>', 'I like the blue/yellow in the top half of the photo. Maybe crop out some of the gray foreground.', '2006-07-18 03:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632183, 361971, 62249, '<td valign="top">Glad to see girls doing martial arts. Would like a richer range of tones in this one.</td>', 'Glad to see girls doing martial arts. Would like a richer range of tones in this one.', '2006-07-18 03:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632188, 361568, 62249, '<td valign="top">Does Demi know about this? Nice composition, nice exposure, nice photo.</td>', 'Does Demi know about this? Nice composition, nice exposure, nice photo.', '2006-07-18 03:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632220, 361402, 22301, '<td valign="top">sweet use of selective desataturation to really make John Deere pop off the page</td>', 'sweet use of selective desataturation to really make John Deere pop off the page', '2006-07-18 04:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632224, 359184, 22301, '<td valign="top">excellent, I love the contrast between old and new, the country lines vs. impeding city conformity, 9</td>', 'excellent, I love the contrast between old and new, the country lines vs. impeding city conformity, 9', '2006-07-18 04:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632232, 361630, 22301, '<td valign="top">I wonder where this is board as I don''t recognize Hyde Park or the money denomination. A bonus point for the off tilt dice. Also I am not sure since I don''t know the board but I think the car is going the wrong way.</td>', 'I wonder where this is board as I don''t recognize Hyde Park or the money denomination. A bonus point for the off tilt dice. Also I am not sure since I don''t know the board but I think the car is going the wrong way.', '2006-07-18 04:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632239, 361976, 22301, '<td valign="top">I don''t get progress from this photo, sorry looked for a good 30 seconds and couldn''t come up with anyway  to connect it to progress, I''ll come back and read you notes to see what I missed, I''m curious</td>', 'I don''t get progress from this photo, sorry looked for a good 30 seconds and couldn''t come up with anyway  to connect it to progress, I''ll come back and read you notes to see what I missed, I''m curious', '2006-07-18 04:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
