(2632282, 362294, 60195, '<td valign="top">this is such a great shot.  Love the facial expression! Not sure, but i REALLY hope this scores high.  My pick of the competition :O) 9</td>', 'this is such a great shot.  Love the facial expression! Not sure, but i REALLY hope this scores high.  My pick of the competition :O) 9', '2006-07-18 04:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632283, 362176, 22301, '<td valign="top">this is a nice capture of the impending construction with the tree helps. I wish the sky wasn''t blown out quite so much though. The only other thing I would comment is with the title, I know it is part of a song but you have no parking lot in your photo. just my suggestions</td>', 'this is a nice capture of the impending construction with the tree helps. I wish the sky wasn''t blown out quite so much though. The only other thing I would comment is with the title, I know it is part of a song but you have no parking lot in your photo. just my suggestions', '2006-07-18 04:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632285, 362325, 22301, '<td valign="top">wow, this great, I don''t know if you have been doing this every year with your child holding the photo or if you photoshopped this together printed one then the child hold it. Either way it is a great idea and an excellent representation of the challenge topic. I can also see your progression as a photographer through these images as well.</td>', 'wow, this great, I don''t know if you have been doing this every year with your child holding the photo or if you photoshopped this together printed one then the child hold it. Either way it is a great idea and an excellent representation of the challenge topic. I can also see your progression as a photographer through these images as well.', '2006-07-18 04:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632286, 362524, 60195, '<td valign="top">great concept and execution.  I like the overall ''feel'' of this, and imagine it''s close to how you pictured it. well done! :o) 9</td>', 'great concept and execution.  I like the overall ''feel'' of this, and imagine it''s close to how you pictured it. well done! :o) 9', '2006-07-18 04:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632289, 362489, 60195, '<td valign="top">very interesting picture.  this one seems to stick with me. very surreal. i think this may have done better in straight B&amp;W (?). nicely done! 8</td>', 'very interesting picture.  this one seems to stick with me. very surreal. i think this may have done better in straight B&W (?). nicely done! 8', '2006-07-18 05:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632290, 361675, 60195, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  great concept &amp; execution... nice touch with the Sun reflection.  Strong 7</td>', 'nicely done.  great concept & execution... nice touch with the Sun reflection.  Strong 7', '2006-07-18 05:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632319, 362294, 22301, '<td valign="top">I love this wide camera angle of this shot, I also like how the depth of field is shallow but the focus of the childs face and ages on the wall really show the theme of the challenge, excellent 10</td>', 'I love this wide camera angle of this shot, I also like how the depth of field is shallow but the focus of the childs face and ages on the wall really show the theme of the challenge, excellent 10', '2006-07-18 05:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632348, 362035, 22301, '<td valign="top">The title gets it from me I love the irony. I wish that the picture was alittle less bright everthing seems abit to overexposed, I think it would have made the sky alittle more blue. but I still love and you get a nine from me</td>', 'The title gets it from me I love the irony. I wish that the picture was alittle less bright everthing seems abit to overexposed, I think it would have made the sky alittle more blue. but I still love and you get a nine from me', '2006-07-18 06:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632364, 362475, 22301, '<td valign="top">I wish this had alittle more depth of field but the image is great and like the composition</td>', 'I wish this had alittle more depth of field but the image is great and like the composition', '2006-07-18 06:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632366, 360357, 22301, '<td valign="top">really like the lighting and the use of red</td>', 'really like the lighting and the use of red', '2006-07-18 06:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632367, 362090, 22301, '<td valign="top">I alway like this perspective of using windows on cars and to see how they are distorted. Also shows both the symbol of our use of electricity reflected through our use of the gas in cars. The border isn''t too bad but I think it would have been better about half the sie</td>', 'I alway like this perspective of using windows on cars and to see how they are distorted. Also shows both the symbol of our use of electricity reflected through our use of the gas in cars. The border isn''t too bad but I think it would have been better about half the sie', '2006-07-18 06:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632369, 362515, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice angle and great expression on the model''s face</td>', 'nice angle and great expression on the model''s face', '2006-07-18 06:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632374, 362063, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like this image becasue although it shows progress and expansion for the city, the tilt of the sign and the fact that it feels like it is falling off screen gives the feeling that the city is losing something also</td>', 'I like this image becasue although it shows progress and expansion for the city, the tilt of the sign and the fact that it feels like it is falling off screen gives the feeling that the city is losing something also', '2006-07-18 06:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632375, 360209, 22301, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot and reflection, 8</td>', 'beautiful shot and reflection, 8', '2006-07-18 06:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632377, 359557, 22301, '<td valign="top">great shot, the only suggestion I would make is to iron your sheet and keep it tight as the wrinkles I find distracting, *</td>', 'great shot, the only suggestion I would make is to iron your sheet and keep it tight as the wrinkles I find distracting, *', '2006-07-18 06:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632380, 361864, 22301, '<td valign="top">excellent example of progress for better or worse, great colors also</td>', 'excellent example of progress for better or worse, great colors also', '2006-07-18 06:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632382, 362486, 22301, '<td valign="top">great choice to go black and white, it really brings out the lines of the freeway, bumping up</td>', 'great choice to go black and white, it really brings out the lines of the freeway, bumping up', '2006-07-18 06:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632383, 360283, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the out of focusness of the shot it really feels like someone is ascending</td>', 'I like the out of focusness of the shot it really feels like someone is ascending', '2006-07-18 06:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632387, 361633, 22301, '<td valign="top">great studio work, lighting is excellent and like how the shadow of the ipod falls right onto the cassette</td>', 'great studio work, lighting is excellent and like how the shadow of the ipod falls right onto the cassette', '2006-07-18 06:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632388, 362351, 22301, '<td valign="top">simple and yet matches the challenge perfectly, I only wish the depth of field was alittle deeper so that the entire wire and plant were in focus, still bumping up</td>', 'simple and yet matches the challenge perfectly, I only wish the depth of field was alittle deeper so that the entire wire and plant were in focus, still bumping up', '2006-07-18 06:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632390, 361406, 22301, '<td valign="top">exellent cadid, or if posed well done, but I like how you showed "progress" in progress.  Great colors and  light also</td>', 'exellent cadid, or if posed well done, but I like how you showed "progress" in progress.  Great colors and  light also', '2006-07-18 06:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632521, 361488, 62127, '<td valign="top">I Love the movment in this shot, great work.</td>', 'I Love the movment in this shot, great work.', '2006-07-18 08:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632524, 360945, 27482, '<td valign="top">No offense here but I feel that the only thing linking this image to the challenge topic is the title, I just don´t see it.  At least if you had a sky as the backround or something like that it would fit better.  Still didn´t really vote as DNMC, just wanted to point out how I see this image.</td>', 'No offense here but I feel that the only thing linking this image to the challenge topic is the title, I just don´t see it.  At least if you had a sky as the backround or something like that it would fit better.  Still didn´t really vote as DNMC, just wanted to point out how I see this image.', '2006-07-18 08:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632527, 362063, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am not really fond of the clipping of the road sign, I think I would have liked this image better if all of it had been in the frame and you had used the road more diagonally to draw the eye in towatds it.  In short, I think you could have composed this better.</td>', 'I am not really fond of the clipping of the road sign, I think I would have liked this image better if all of it had been in the frame and you had used the road more diagonally to draw the eye in towatds it.  In short, I think you could have composed this better.', '2006-07-18 08:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632531, 360208, 27482, '<td valign="top">Yuck, nasty neighbourhood, no wonder the delivery guy looks so down :P</td>', 'Yuck, nasty neighbourhood, no wonder the delivery guy looks so down :P', '2006-07-18 08:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632535, 362367, 27482, '<td valign="top">This shot is pretty cool, awesome moment you captured here.  Franky, I think this is likely to ribbon in this challenge, however, I "only" gave it a 7.  There is something with the backround that throws me a bit off this image, somehow the difference in lighting and the fact that it´s so busy despite being out of focus draws too much of my attention from the bird and the nest.  Like I said, still gave this a 7 and wouldn´t be surprised to see this ribbon or at least make top 10, this should do well here.</td>', 'This shot is pretty cool, awesome moment you captured here.  Franky, I think this is likely to ribbon in this challenge, however, I "only" gave it a 7.  There is something with the backround that throws me a bit off this image, somehow the difference in lighting and the fact that it´s so busy despite being out of focus draws too much of my attention from the bird and the nest.  Like I said, still gave this a 7 and wouldn´t be surprised to see this ribbon or at least make top 10, this should do well here.', '2006-07-18 08:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632536, 362294, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the sepia toning in this one, nice job.  Wish you wouldn´t have cut off just the tip of the elbow like that but that´s just nitpicking.  7 from me.</td>', 'Love the sepia toning in this one, nice job.  Wish you wouldn´t have cut off just the tip of the elbow like that but that´s just nitpicking.  7 from me.', '2006-07-18 08:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632542, 360692, 27482, '<td valign="top">No offense but I have never understood what people get out of going to these airshows and taking photographs, the subject just doesn´t do anything for me.  Well enough about that.  Photographically speaking, this is not bad at all, just not really all that fond of the composition, not bad really but kindof dull and centered, nothing but dead smack in the middle of the frame.  Then also I always think images that use too fast shutterspeeds at motorraces and airshows make the subjects seem a bit static.  I appreciate the fact that you have a very slight amount of motion blur on the propeller but just not enough for me, wish they were more blurred but at the same time the planes were tack sharp.  Think I saw somewhere that an optimal shutterspeed for propeller airplanes were somewhere between 1/100-1/200?  Anyway, nuff ranting, not a bad shot, just wanted to explain why I couldn´t give this more than a 5 wich means average for me.</td>', 'No offense but I have never understood what people get out of going to these airshows and taking photographs, the subject just doesn´t do anything for me.  Well enough about that.  Photographically speaking, this is not bad at all, just not really all that fond of the composition, not bad really but kindof dull and centered, nothing but dead smack in the middle of the frame.  Then also I always think images that use too fast shutterspeeds at motorraces and airshows make the subjects seem a bit static.  I appreciate the fact that you have a very slight amount of motion blur on the propeller but just not enough for me, wish they were more blurred but at the same time the planes were tack sharp.  Think I saw somewhere that an optimal shutterspeed for propeller airplanes were somewhere between 1/100-1/200?  Anyway, nuff ranting, not a bad shot, just wanted to explain why I couldn´t give this more than a 5 wich means average for me.', '2006-07-18 08:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632543, 361952, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the dof and bokeh, just wish the whole image was a bit brighter as the backround is kindof too dark and blends in with the foreground because of that.  6 from me.</td>', 'Love the dof and bokeh, just wish the whole image was a bit brighter as the backround is kindof too dark and blends in with the foreground because of that.  6 from me.', '2006-07-18 08:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632545, 360805, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but not at all fond of the strong halo around the subject, definately a turnoff for me personally, would have given a 5 but that knocked you down to a 4.</td>', 'Sorry but not at all fond of the strong halo around the subject, definately a turnoff for me personally, would have given a 5 but that knocked you down to a 4.', '2006-07-18 08:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632546, 362486, 27482, '<td valign="top">Jeez, what a maze!  Progress my ass, DNMC!!!  Just kidding :)  Like this shot, well composed and great b/w tones too.  7 from me.</td>', 'Jeez, what a maze!  Progress my ass, DNMC!!!  Just kidding :)  Like this shot, well composed and great b/w tones too.  7 from me.', '2006-07-18 08:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632549, 361971, 27482, '<td valign="top">I´d watch out, that little girl looks mean and I wouldn´t wanna run into her in a dark alley, she´d probably kick my ass :P<br/> <br/>Nice shot, great tones in it and love the expressions on the models :)</td>', 'I´d watch out, that little girl looks mean and I wouldn´t wanna run into her in a dark alley, she´d probably kick my ass :P Nice shot, great tones in it and love the expressions on the models :)', '2006-07-18 08:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632556, 360209, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, like how the ripples in the water lead the eye towards the factory.  7 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot, like how the ripples in the water lead the eye towards the factory.  7 from me.', '2006-07-18 08:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632557, 362537, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  Somehow I just dig the "expression" on the dragonfish, nice work, also technically speaking, crystal clear and sharp, excellent image quality.</td>', 'Lol!  Somehow I just dig the "expression" on the dragonfish, nice work, also technically speaking, crystal clear and sharp, excellent image quality.', '2006-07-18 08:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632563, 362049, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but not at all digging the effect the wide angle lens has on the face of that person up in the right corner.  Also the WB is completely off and lastly I don´t really see a strong connection to the theme here so I voted this a 3.</td>', 'Sorry but not at all digging the effect the wide angle lens has on the face of that person up in the right corner.  Also the WB is completely off and lastly I don´t really see a strong connection to the theme here so I voted this a 3.', '2006-07-18 08:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632569, 362353, 27482, '<td valign="top">You fishing for a whole bunch of low ratings?  Well I have a strong feeling this is an attempt at getting the lowest score all time here at dpc so I am gonna attempt to foil your plan and "troll" you, did the exact opposite, 10 from me :P</td>', 'You fishing for a whole bunch of low ratings?  Well I have a strong feeling this is an attempt at getting the lowest score all time here at dpc so I am gonna attempt to foil your plan and "troll" you, did the exact opposite, 10 from me :P', '2006-07-18 08:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632582, 361356, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ummm, not really the expert here but seems to me he is on his way down, not up, ergo no progress really but what the heck, that is just nitpicking and I didn´t let that affect the score at all, I am not THAT petty, hehe :P<br/> <br/>Shot is nice, nothing that is blowing me away.  Decently exposed and composed though, gave it a 6.</td>', 'Ummm, not really the expert here but seems to me he is on his way down, not up, ergo no progress really but what the heck, that is just nitpicking and I didn´t let that affect the score at all, I am not THAT petty, hehe :P Shot is nice, nothing that is blowing me away.  Decently exposed and composed though, gave it a 6.', '2006-07-18 09:04:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2632605, 361402, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wierd, at first I only saw snow there but then I noticed the wierd texture and saw that it was rocks, funny how the mind can play tricks on you when you are used to see snow large portions of the year.  Nice shot, I think the centered composition works well here and I find it interesting.  7</td>', 'Wierd, at first I only saw snow there but then I noticed the wierd texture and saw that it was rocks, funny how the mind can play tricks on you when you are used to see snow large portions of the year.  Nice shot, I think the centered composition works well here and I find it interesting.  7', '2006-07-18 09:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632617, 362345, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the idea itself but I think you could have executed it better, what bothers me most is the lighting used here, kindof hard and strong on the dress and then next to none on the lady in the backround.  Looks so off even that I am strongly suspecting that the lady is in fact just a picture you printed out or cut out of a magazine and put up on a wall in the backround, again, because of the difference in lighting.  Like I said, like the idea, just needs better execution.</td>', 'I like the idea itself but I think you could have executed it better, what bothers me most is the lighting used here, kindof hard and strong on the dress and then next to none on the lady in the backround.  Looks so off even that I am strongly suspecting that the lady is in fact just a picture you printed out or cut out of a magazine and put up on a wall in the backround, again, because of the difference in lighting.  Like I said, like the idea, just needs better execution.', '2006-07-18 09:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632619, 361864, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and clarity here, you got that part of the photo nailed.</td>', 'Nice colors and clarity here, you got that part of the photo nailed.', '2006-07-18 09:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632621, 361630, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice touch having one of the dice slanted like that, makes the image slightly more dynamic and exciting.  The wb seems a bit off to me, too warm for my taste.</td>', 'Nice touch having one of the dice slanted like that, makes the image slightly more dynamic and exciting.  The wb seems a bit off to me, too warm for my taste.', '2006-07-18 09:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632629, 362462, 27482, '<td valign="top">You gotta be more careful with the saturation levels when your subject is such strong red, the red channel doesn´t hold much detail and is easily blown out, I find that lowering the saturation slightly and then increasing the contrast works better when working with bright red subjects.  Nice shot anyway, gave it a 6.</td>', 'You gotta be more careful with the saturation levels when your subject is such strong red, the red channel doesn´t hold much detail and is easily blown out, I find that lowering the saturation slightly and then increasing the contrast works better when working with bright red subjects.  Nice shot anyway, gave it a 6.', '2006-07-18 09:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632631, 362042, 27482, '<td valign="top">I can promise you making the most of the allowed 640 pixles will lead to better scores here.</td>', 'I can promise you making the most of the allowed 640 pixles will lead to better scores here.', '2006-07-18 09:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632635, 361675, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice touch including the reflection of the sunset there and around the hybrid logo.  Only to nitpick, wish the sun wasn´t blown out like that but I like the color contrasts in it, green vs. purple vs. orange.  7 from me, I dig this image.</td>', 'Nice touch including the reflection of the sunset there and around the hybrid logo.  Only to nitpick, wish the sun wasn´t blown out like that but I like the color contrasts in it, green vs. purple vs. orange.  7 from me, I dig this image.', '2006-07-18 09:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632640, 362203, 27482, '<td valign="top">I would have voted this image higher if it were sharper and clearer, seems a bit soft.  Did you sharpen as the last step after resizing?</td>', 'I would have voted this image higher if it were sharper and clearer, seems a bit soft.  Did you sharpen as the last step after resizing?', '2006-07-18 09:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632641, 361562, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, dig the funky colors in it.  7</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, dig the funky colors in it.  7', '2006-07-18 09:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632642, 362524, 27482, '<td valign="top">That looks a bit funky, wierd seeing the "world" melt like that, hehe :P  Point taken, I´ll stop passing gas in an effort to save our planet! :D</td>', 'That looks a bit funky, wierd seeing the "world" melt like that, hehe :P  Point taken, I´ll stop passing gas in an effort to save our planet! :D', '2006-07-18 09:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632643, 362510, 27482, '<td valign="top">Yeah, who needs a herring/apple anyways?  Lol!</td>', 'Yeah, who needs a herring/apple anyways?  Lol!', '2006-07-18 09:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632645, 362359, 27482, '<td valign="top">I would have voted this shot higher if it had been in better focus, looks like you were slightly off in this particular shot.</td>', 'I would have voted this shot higher if it had been in better focus, looks like you were slightly off in this particular shot.', '2006-07-18 09:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632692, 362531, 27482, '<td valign="top">Dude, that´s just mean!  Like picking wings of flies or something, lol!  Poor fella never knew what hit him, just suddenly had a dart in front of his face, hehe :)  I actually laughed out loud with this one, we apparently have the same sense of humor!  7 from me.</td>', 'Dude, that´s just mean!  Like picking wings of flies or something, lol!  Poor fella never knew what hit him, just suddenly had a dart in front of his face, hehe :)  I actually laughed out loud with this one, we apparently have the same sense of humor!  7 from me.', '2006-07-18 10:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632695, 361488, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hah, very creative, nice use of long shutterspeed, I dig it!  7</td>', 'Hah, very creative, nice use of long shutterspeed, I dig it!  7', '2006-07-18 10:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632698, 362542, 27482, '<td valign="top">Really wish the image quality was higher with this one, it´s pretty terrible and I see this file is only 10 kb large so that explains it, make the most of the 150kb you are allowed and I promise you your score will go up.  If you are not sure how, there is a tutorial how to prepare shots for challenges in the learn column up here.</td>', 'Really wish the image quality was higher with this one, it´s pretty terrible and I see this file is only 10 kb large so that explains it, make the most of the 150kb you are allowed and I promise you your score will go up.  If you are not sure how, there is a tutorial how to prepare shots for challenges in the learn column up here.', '2006-07-18 10:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632713, 360077, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I gotta say I don´t care for the post processing at all, the look of the image doesn´t appeal to me.  Specifically the blown highlights on the book and cigarette package, the texture on the red cloth or material and the wierd grey pixelation on the lighter.  No offense meant, just make a habit of explaining why when I vote 3 or lower and this image got a 3 from me.</td>', 'Sorry but I gotta say I don´t care for the post processing at all, the look of the image doesn´t appeal to me.  Specifically the blown highlights on the book and cigarette package, the texture on the red cloth or material and the wierd grey pixelation on the lighter.  No offense meant, just make a habit of explaining why when I vote 3 or lower and this image got a 3 from me.', '2006-07-18 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632719, 361406, 27482, '<td valign="top">Yeah...  Sometimes I just wanna drop that little thing straight down the toilet, lol!</td>', 'Yeah...  Sometimes I just wanna drop that little thing straight down the toilet, lol!', '2006-07-18 10:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632723, 361491, 27482, '<td valign="top">Um, sorry but how is this progress, did you mean to send this into the perspective challenge?  You got something against rabbits or am I missing the point here cause I don´t get the thougth process behind this shot at all...</td>', 'Um, sorry but how is this progress, did you mean to send this into the perspective challenge?  You got something against rabbits or am I missing the point here cause I don´t get the thougth process behind this shot at all...', '2006-07-18 10:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632731, 361798, 27482, '<td valign="top">Is this possibly taken in the phillipines with a D200 by a multi ribbon winner?  Certainly has that image look Manny uses a lot of the time.  Anyway, Manny or not, this shot is very good, while I really like shallow DOF I just wish this time the boy in the backround had been a little more in focus...  Still a 7 in my books.</td>', 'Is this possibly taken in the phillipines with a D200 by a multi ribbon winner?  Certainly has that image look Manny uses a lot of the time.  Anyway, Manny or not, this shot is very good, while I really like shallow DOF I just wish this time the boy in the backround had been a little more in focus...  Still a 7 in my books.', '2006-07-18 10:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632734, 361985, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but way way way too dark for my taste, and yes, my screen is calibrated.</td>', 'Sorry but way way way too dark for my taste, and yes, my screen is calibrated.', '2006-07-18 10:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632742, 361670, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, have never really been a fan of selective desat and especially when I don´t see it having a purpouse and that is the case for me here, to me it seems the selective desat has no purpouse and I am 99% sure I would have liked the color version or a plain b/w version much better.  Not a bad shot though, gave it a 5.</td>', 'Sorry, have never really been a fan of selective desat and especially when I don´t see it having a purpouse and that is the case for me here, to me it seems the selective desat has no purpouse and I am 99% sure I would have liked the color version or a plain b/w version much better.  Not a bad shot though, gave it a 5.', '2006-07-18 10:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632746, 362104, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well tell Steve to stop holding his nose, tiling goes much faster when you have both hands available :P</td>', 'Well tell Steve to stop holding his nose, tiling goes much faster when you have both hands available :P', '2006-07-18 10:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632749, 362237, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the even lighting and strong colors/contrast.</td>', 'Nice job on the even lighting and strong colors/contrast.', '2006-07-18 10:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632764, 361491, 30049, '<td valign="top">Even with an open mind I''m having a tough time seeing a connection to the challenge ''Progress'' with this image.  Sorry.</td>', 'Even with an open mind I''m having a tough time seeing a connection to the challenge ''Progress'' with this image.  Sorry.', '2006-07-18 10:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632859, 362353, 58840, '<td valign="top">okee dokee</td>', 'okee dokee', '2006-07-18 11:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632862, 362489, 54778, '<td valign="top">the first pic of the challenge that made me sit up. A very good shot and if you have time you should setup very mild sun rise colours at the horizon between the rocks and the buildings. Not only will that put a healthy balance of colours but also add to to the whole progress thing since sunrises represent new beginnings and stuff. A very cool shot.</td>', 'the first pic of the challenge that made me sit up. A very good shot and if you have time you should setup very mild sun rise colours at the horizon between the rocks and the buildings. Not only will that put a healthy balance of colours but also add to to the whole progress thing since sunrises represent new beginnings and stuff. A very cool shot.', '2006-07-18 11:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632878, 361955, 54778, '<td valign="top">Nice catch but I think you could have improved this a bit working with the colours. I would have liked them a little less harsher</td>', 'Nice catch but I think you could have improved this a bit working with the colours. I would have liked them a little less harsher', '2006-07-18 11:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632900, 362194, 27482, '<td valign="top">My vote goes for the avensis, had one and loved it.  The horse buggy really hurts my cute little butt!</td>', 'My vote goes for the avensis, had one and loved it.  The horse buggy really hurts my cute little butt!', '2006-07-18 11:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632901, 360926, 27482, '<td valign="top">I dunno, the old one is much better at beating people with :P  Nice dof and good touch of having that hand in the photo.</td>', 'I dunno, the old one is much better at beating people with :P  Nice dof and good touch of having that hand in the photo.', '2006-07-18 11:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
