(2632904, 362489, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really fond of the blue duotone here, I think I would have liked this shot better in just plain b/w or in low sat, strong contrast color.  Nice idea though and well executed.</td>', 'Not really fond of the blue duotone here, I think I would have liked this shot better in just plain b/w or in low sat, strong contrast color.  Nice idea though and well executed.', '2006-07-18 11:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632905, 362527, 27482, '<td valign="top">I dunno what it is but I really like this shot, something about the sinister appearance of donald, he seems like he´s about to run over an old lady or something, lol!  Nice lighting and tonality, great DOF.  7</td>', 'I dunno what it is but I really like this shot, something about the sinister appearance of donald, he seems like he´s about to run over an old lady or something, lol!  Nice lighting and tonality, great DOF.  7', '2006-07-18 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632908, 362209, 54778, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2006-07-18 11:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632909, 359184, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition of the houses, the backround house is a bit too busy though and draws too much of my attention that way.  Maybe if you had desaturated the red in the shot so the color would not be so strong in them the image wouldn´t be so hard to look at.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition of the houses, the backround house is a bit too busy though and draws too much of my attention that way.  Maybe if you had desaturated the red in the shot so the color would not be so strong in them the image wouldn´t be so hard to look at.', '2006-07-18 11:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632913, 362025, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad as a shot, just too harsh lighting for my taste and I don´t really care for the black backround.  Try using a bigger aperture next time or a bigger lightsource, just something that isn´t so harsh and I bet you´ll like the outcome much better after that.</td>', 'Not bad as a shot, just too harsh lighting for my taste and I don´t really care for the black backround.  Try using a bigger aperture next time or a bigger lightsource, just something that isn´t so harsh and I bet you´ll like the outcome much better after that.', '2006-07-18 11:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632917, 362467, 27482, '<td valign="top">Didn´t figure out they were dudes at first, thought they were small birds or something, man that house must be BIG!</td>', 'Didn´t figure out they were dudes at first, thought they were small birds or something, man that house must be BIG!', '2006-07-18 11:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632919, 362134, 27482, '<td valign="top">The broken glass that is out of focus and in front of the whole photo bothers me a bit, kindof an attention stealer but the rest of the shot I like, love the DOF and the coloring in it.  6</td>', 'The broken glass that is out of focus and in front of the whole photo bothers me a bit, kindof an attention stealer but the rest of the shot I like, love the DOF and the coloring in it.  6', '2006-07-18 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632921, 361851, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! :)</td>', 'Congratulations! :)', '2006-07-18 11:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632922, 361568, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! :)</td>', 'Congratulations! :)', '2006-07-18 11:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632925, 360283, 27482, '<td valign="top">Thumbnail looked nice but I was kindof dissapointed when I opened this shot, mainly for the lack of image quality.  Specifically I dislike the out of focus feet, the noise in the backround and the blown out highlight in the upper corner and frankly gave this shot a 3, I think the image quality is that bad.  Shame as I like the thought process behind the image and if you had executed it better I would have given this a MUCH higher rating.</td>', 'Thumbnail looked nice but I was kindof dissapointed when I opened this shot, mainly for the lack of image quality.  Specifically I dislike the out of focus feet, the noise in the backround and the blown out highlight in the upper corner and frankly gave this shot a 3, I think the image quality is that bad.  Shame as I like the thought process behind the image and if you had executed it better I would have given this a MUCH higher rating.', '2006-07-18 11:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632926, 362151, 27482, '<td valign="top">Huh?  You carry water in your camera bag? :P  Lol!</td>', 'Huh?  You carry water in your camera bag? :P  Lol!', '2006-07-18 11:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632928, 362253, 27482, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, you just need to work on your lighting, have more of it specifically as this image is very very dark and extremely flat contrast wise.</td>', 'Like the idea, you just need to work on your lighting, have more of it specifically as this image is very very dark and extremely flat contrast wise.', '2006-07-18 12:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632930, 359557, 37384, '<td valign="top">Very good congratulations...</td>', 'Very good congratulations...', '2006-07-18 12:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632942, 362163, 27482, '<td valign="top">There is something that I can´t put my finger on regarding this photo that throws me way off, did you use a tool like shadow/highlights and took it to the extreme?  Anyway, I must say whatever it is, wether the lighting was just very wierd that day where you were or if it was due to some PP tweaking this just looks wierd to me and I don´t really care for the outcome.  4 from me.</td>', 'There is something that I can´t put my finger on regarding this photo that throws me way off, did you use a tool like shadow/highlights and took it to the extreme?  Anyway, I must say whatever it is, wether the lighting was just very wierd that day where you were or if it was due to some PP tweaking this just looks wierd to me and I don´t really care for the outcome.  4 from me.', '2006-07-18 12:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632947, 362476, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, just wish you had taken it closer to the sunset and had just a hint of blue in the sky, the sky is easily the weak point of this photo, for me at least.  Still dig this shot, good vantage point and gave it a 7.</td>', 'Cool shot, just wish you had taken it closer to the sunset and had just a hint of blue in the sky, the sky is easily the weak point of this photo, for me at least.  Still dig this shot, good vantage point and gave it a 7.', '2006-07-18 12:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
