(2633662, 359277, 46314, '<td valign="top">Clever. Reflected purple light on the glass is a bit distracting. But not enough that it ruins it. I like the composition - the progression of the tomatoes really leads the eye into the photo.</td>', 'Clever. Reflected purple light on the glass is a bit distracting. But not enough that it ruins it. I like the composition - the progression of the tomatoes really leads the eye into the photo.', '2006-07-18 17:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
