(2633759, 362510, 22301, '<td valign="top">this is great idea, my ownly suggestion would be to use a larger file size, yours is 95 kb and the max is 150 kb. Using the whole allowable file size would help with the jagged edges in the small details for exaple around the eye the fish. Here is the link to the challenge submission <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a>. This tutorial is designed for photoshop, but should be similat in other programs. I thought this was great I gave it a 7.</td>', 'this is great idea, my ownly suggestion would be to use a larger file size, yours is 95 kb and the max is 150 kb. Using the whole allowable file size would help with the jagged edges in the small details for exaple around the eye the fish. Here is the link to the challenge submission tutorial. This tutorial is designed for photoshop, but should be similat in other programs. I thought this was great I gave it a 7.', '2006-07-18 18:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633761, 362378, 22301, '<td valign="top">great lighting and I really like the use of blue to tie both mediums together.</td>', 'great lighting and I really like the use of blue to tie both mediums together.', '2006-07-18 18:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633763, 362500, 60027, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  Shows us how progress is relational, eh?</td>', 'I like this picture.  Shows us how progress is relational, eh?', '2006-07-18 18:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
