(2634823, 360248, 48717, '<td valign="top">Great natural moment captured.  Really, really nice black and white treatment! <br/> <br/>A few observations...<br/>- without the title, it would be hard to pinpoint the progress here.<br/>- the old man in the bright white shirt is a bit distracting, my eye continues to drift back to him.  I wonder if a crop of only the three boys would have worked better.<br/>- the bench/horizon is tilted.  Take a look at <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=21" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> tutorial, it may help.<br/> <br/>Good Luck!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-19 00:16:07.</i></td>', 'Great natural moment captured.  Really, really nice black and white treatment!  A few observations...- without the title, it would be hard to pinpoint the progress here.- the old man in the bright white shirt is a bit distracting, my eye continues to drift back to him.  I wonder if a crop of only the three boys would have worked better.- the bench/horizon is tilted.  Take a look at this tutorial, it may help. Good Luck!', '2006-07-19 00:54:38.000000', '2006-07-19 01:16:07.000000', 1),
