(2634956, 362500, 48890, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by puzzled:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a powerful picture. The light is quite harsh, but maybe that''s what you were after to emphasize the harsh life. I can imagine that black &amp; white might work well in this image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I considered B&amp;W, but decided that colour works well here.  There are only two major colours here (blues and reds), I don''t think colour is distracting here.</td>', 'Originally posted by puzzled: This is a powerful picture. The light is quite harsh, but maybe that''s what you were after to emphasize the harsh life. I can imagine that black & white might work well in this image.  I considered B&W, but decided that colour works well here.  There are only two major colours here (blues and reds), I don''t think colour is distracting here.', '2006-07-19 01:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
