(2636915, 361123, 59415, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all that voted.<br/> <br/>Ya, this building has been shot alot.  I figured there would be more than one in the challenge.  Here is an album cover with it:)<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.americagomorrah.com/media/ag-etfal-cover180.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.americagomorrah.com/media/ag-etfal-cover180.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.americagomorrah.com/media/ag-etfal-cover180.jpg"/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-21 10:22:34.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all that voted. Ya, this building has been shot alot.  I figured there would be more than one in the challenge.  Here is an album cover with it:) ', '2006-07-19 10:17:35.000000', '2006-07-21 11:22:34.000000', 0),
