(2636959, 360802, 28710, '<td valign="top">Hrm. Am I the only one that sees the weird edges? Looks like there''s a fairly strong case of oversharpening here. Was this intentional Ben?</td>', 'Hrm. Am I the only one that sees the weird edges? Looks like there''s a fairly strong case of oversharpening here. Was this intentional Ben?', '2006-07-19 10:34:09.000000', NULL, 0),
