(2637010, 360802, 2780, '<td valign="top">It wasn''t intentional no... I don''t see anything?</td>', 'It wasn''t intentional no... I don''t see anything?', '2006-07-19 10:43:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2637036, 362294, 9690, '<td valign="top">I thought this was head-and-shoulders above the rest (pun intended).  Such a clear choice for a blue.  Great job!</td>', 'I thought this was head-and-shoulders above the rest (pun intended).  Such a clear choice for a blue.  Great job!', '2006-07-19 10:47:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2637039, 362294, 36382, '<td valign="top">Yeah, actually I agree about the elbow.  I struggled with how to deal with it.  It seemed to take up so much space because of the wide-angle distortion and it was just touching the edge of the frame in any case.  I might go back and rethink the crop though.  <br/> <br/>Also I was asked whether this was taken from a ladder.  The answer is "No".  I used the 24-70 mm lens at its widest setting, and on the 5D which has no crop factor, this makes for quite a wide angle.  The shot was just taken with me standing above her.  I had to crop out part of my foot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-19 11:18:22.</i></td>', 'Yeah, actually I agree about the elbow.  I struggled with how to deal with it.  It seemed to take up so much space because of the wide-angle distortion and it was just touching the edge of the frame in any case.  I might go back and rethink the crop though.   Also I was asked whether this was taken from a ladder.  The answer is "No".  I used the 24-70 mm lens at its widest setting, and on the 5D which has no crop factor, this makes for quite a wide angle.  The shot was just taken with me standing above her.  I had to crop out part of my foot.', '2006-07-19 10:48:00.000000', '2006-07-19 12:18:22.000000', 0),
(2637045, 361952, 42601, '<td valign="top">I was seriously hoping this one would be top three at least.<br/> <br/>The best representation of progress I have seen, and well executed.<br/> <br/>Pity, but still an awesome shot.</td>', 'I was seriously hoping this one would be top three at least. The best representation of progress I have seen, and well executed. Pity, but still an awesome shot.', '2006-07-19 10:48:25.000000', NULL, 0),
