(2638757, 362058, 40580, '<td valign="top">Wow, this picture did better than I thought.  This picture did better than my top pick for this challenge.  Nice idea.  Did you see the 1st place winner?  That''s the one I was referring to in my comment.  I''m suprised it did that well too.<br/> <br/>This is a great first challenge picture.  Good luck on other challenges since you''ve set your bar so high.</td>', 'Wow, this picture did better than I thought.  This picture did better than my top pick for this challenge.  Nice idea.  Did you see the 1st place winner?  That''s the one I was referring to in my comment.  I''m suprised it did that well too. This is a great first challenge picture.  Good luck on other challenges since you''ve set your bar so high.', '2006-07-19 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
