(2694569, 362494, 62187, '<td valign="top">Ok, now that I''m going back over the photos I commented on, I''ve realized the photo DOES NOT need ''Logs''. The topic was ''Progress'' and we''ve progressed from using log rafts to yachts! Good lord how can I be so unobservant?!?!?!?!?!</td>', 'Ok, now that I''m going back over the photos I commented on, I''ve realized the photo DOES NOT need ''Logs''. The topic was ''Progress'' and we''ve progressed from using log rafts to yachts! Good lord how can I be so unobservant?!?!?!?!?!', '2006-08-04 06:13:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2694581, 362500, 62187, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by agenkin:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SkyNevada:</b></div><hr/><i> To me, this is not progress.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>That''s the whole point of this shot, buddy! :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Arcady,<br/> <br/>I must admit - I''m new to DPChallenge and this was my first challenge voting session for lack of better word. I think I ''judged'' a few photos wrongly because I did not read that ''progress - a blessing or a curse'' As others have already said, your photo is powerful and now with my new-found knowledge I realize the meaning of your photo. I was wrong, it fits the requirments superbly and I wish I could take back my vote.<br/> <br/>In the future I will try to pay better attention - life''s a dance you learn as you go - so somebody sang.</td>', 'Originally posted by agenkin: Originally posted by SkyNevada: To me, this is not progress. That''s the whole point of this shot, buddy! :)   Hi Arcady, I must admit - I''m new to DPChallenge and this was my first challenge voting session for lack of better word. I think I ''judged'' a few photos wrongly because I did not read that ''progress - a blessing or a curse'' As others have already said, your photo is powerful and now with my new-found knowledge I realize the meaning of your photo. I was wrong, it fits the requirments superbly and I wish I could take back my vote. In the future I will try to pay better attention - life''s a dance you learn as you go - so somebody sang.', '2006-08-04 06:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
