(2694593, 361491, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hi Patryck,<br/> <br/>I totally wish we knew the story of the photos before we voted on them. I''m embarrassed of my remark below...I will NEVER make one like that again to anybody''s photo. If there''s a good thing in this it''s you have caused me to progress as a individual: hopefully for the better. Thank you...<br/> <br/>Brad</td>', 'Hi Patryck, I totally wish we knew the story of the photos before we voted on them. I''m embarrassed of my remark below...I will NEVER make one like that again to anybody''s photo. If there''s a good thing in this it''s you have caused me to progress as a individual: hopefully for the better. Thank you... Brad', '2006-08-04 07:02:21.000000', NULL, 0),
